<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Isirayila Mangɛe I</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isirayila Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isirayila Mangɛe I</para>
  <para style="toc3">ManI</para>
  <para style="mt">Isirayila Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi kitaabui findixi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui singe nan na. Annabi Samuweli xa kitaabui raɲɔnma mangɛ Dawuda xa taruxui nan na. Yi kitaabui fɔlɔma boore raɲɔnxi dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Alatala nan Dawuda tixi mangɛ ra a xa ɲama Isirayila xun ma. A xa ɲama nu rafan a ma, a nu wama e xa bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra alako duniɲa xa na misaali to. Dawuda to tin birade Ala fɔxɔ ra, Ala naxa laayidi tongo a bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, e xa lu kibanyi kui abadan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawuda to laaxira, a xa di Sulemani naxa ti Isirayila mangɛ ra. Ala naxa baraka sa a xa fe ma a fanyi ra, a findi mangɛ lɔnnixi banna ra. A naxa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti Darisalamu, ɲama nu sɛrɛxɛe bama dɛnnaxɛ. Kɔnɔ a mu bu, a naxa makuya fɔlɔ Ala xa sɛriyɛ ra, a fa kuye batui masunbu Ala batui ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mangɛ Sulemani to gbilen Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra, Alatala naxa a xa tinxinyi masen, a fa Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ xuru fɔlɔ. A naxa a lu e xa e ɲɛrɛ kira ɲaaxi xɔn ma, kɔnɔ a naxa a masen e bɛ na kira ɲaaxi e xun tima dɛnnaxɛ ra. Mangɛ nde bara na fahaamu, a fa gbilen Alatala xa kira ma, kɔnɔ boore mu na mɛ, a xa fe fa raɲɔn gbaloe ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mangɛ Dawuda xa waxati Isirayilakae nu itaxunxi bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firin nan na, naxee fatanxi Annabi Yaxuba xa di fu nun firinyi ra. Ala nu bara Annabi Yaxuba xili masara «Isirayila» ra, a Kanaan bɔxi fi e ma kɛ ra, e xili naxa fala «Isirayilakae.» Kɔnɔ Alatala to Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ ɲaxankata e xa filankafuiɲa xa fe ra, a naxa bɔnsɔɛ fu ba e xa yaamari bun ma, bɔnsɔɛ firin gbansan naxa lu e yi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na bɔnsɔɛ firinyi findixi Yudaya nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ nan na. Yudaya to xungbo boore bɛ, e birin xili naxa sa «Yudaya.» Na bɔnsɔɛ fu naxan baxi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ xa yaamari bun ma, e fan xili naxa sa na waxati «Isirayila.» Mangɛya firin nu na na tɛmui, Yudaya nu na yirefanyi ma, Isirayila nu na kɔɔla ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yudaya mangɛe kata nɛ e xa ɲama xa bira Ala xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. Kɔnɔ Isirayila mangɛe mu tin na ra, e fa kuyee ti e xa mixie bɛ e xa na batu. Mangɛ Yerobowami naxa na wali kobi fɔlɔ Beteli nun Dana, a fa yensen bɔxi birin ma. Mangɛ Axabi naxa Samari findi Isirayila mangataa ra. E na birin naba nɛ alako ɲama naxa lu siga ra Darisalamu sɛrɛxɛe bade alɔ Alatala a yamarixi ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mangɛ Akabu xa waxati, Ala naxa namiɲɔnmɛ nde rakeli naxan xili Annabi Eliya. A xa fe mu nu rafan mangɛ ma fefe ma, kɔnɔ Ala naxa a mali a xa kaabanakoe belebelee raba Isirayilakae ya ma, alako e xa gbilen Ala waxɔnfe ma. Na kui Alatala mu tin a xa ɲama rabolode hali e to nu birama yunubie fɔxɔ ra. A naxa fe birin naba alako e man xa tin lude a xa mangɛya bun ma, e fa a sago raba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa fe raba ki nan na ki. A a xa ɲama ɲaxankatama alako e xa gbilen a ma. A hinnɛma e ra tɛmui birin, hali e na kira ɲaaxi xɔn ma alako a raɲɔnyi e xa kisi sɔtɔ. A na fe mɔɔli fan nabama to mixie ra. Ala xa won mali na fahaamude. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Isirayila Mangɛe xa Taruxui Sɛniyɛnxi singe</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda xa mangɛya raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Mangɛ Dawuda xa simaya nu bara a ikuya. Xinbeli nu na a fate i tɛmui birin, hali dugie to nu felenma a ma a fanyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Na kui, a xa mixie naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ginɛdimɛdi nde xa fen i bɛ, naxan mɛɛnima i ma, a nu fa a sa i fɛ ma alako xinbeli xa ba i ma.» <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />E naxa ginɛdimɛdi tofanyi nde fen Isirayila bɔxi ma, han e sa Abisaga Sunamika to. E naxa na xanin mangɛ xɔn ma. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Na tɛmɛdi nu tofan ki fanyi. A nu mɛɛni mangɛ ma, a nu wali birin naba a bɛ. Kɔnɔ na kui mangɛ mu a kolon ginɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Na tɛmui Xagiti xa di Adoniya naxa a yɛtɛ ite fɔlɔ, a nu fa a fala, «N tan nan findima Isirayila mangɛ ra.» A naxa soe nun kuntigi maɲɛrɛse tongo, a nun korogba tongo suuli. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />A xa simaya kui, a baba Dawuda nu a luxi a yɛtɛ nan yi, a mu nu a falama a bɛ, «Yi lu, yi mu fan?» Adoniya fate nu tofan ki fanyi. Abisalomi xanbiratoe nan nu a ra.<verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />A tan nun Seruya xa di Yowaba nun Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa lan fe keren ma, e xa kafu a ma Adoniya xa mangɛya masɔtɔ. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Kɔnɔ Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya, Annabi Natan, Simeyi, Reyi, nun Dawuda xa sɔɔri sɛnbɛmae naxa tondi birade Adoniya fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adoniya naxa ningee nun yɛxɛɛ bɔrɔgɛxie ba sɛrɛxɛ ra Soxeleti fanye fɛ ma, dɛnnaxɛ na En Rogeli sɛɛti ma. A naxa a ngaxakerenyie, mangɛ xa die, nun mangɛ xa mixie birin xili. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Kɔnɔ a mu Annabi Natan, Bɛnaya, mangɛ xa sɔɔri sɛnbɛmae, nun a xunya Sulemani tan xili.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Natan naxa a fala Sulemani nga Batiseba bɛ, «I mu a mɛxi a Xagiti xa di Adoniya bara findi mangɛ ra, a fa li won marigi Dawuda mu fefe kolonxi na fe kui? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Yakɔsi i naxan nabama, i i tuli mati n ma marasi ra, alako i xa i tan nun i xa di Sulemani nii ratanga. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />I xa siga mangɛ Dawuda yire, i a fala a bɛ, ‹Mangɛ n marigi, i mu laayidi tongo xɛ n tan i xa konyi ginɛ bɛ, fa a fala n ma di Sulemani fama mangɛya sɔtɔde i ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a dɔxɔ i xa kibanyi kui? Munfe ra Adoniya na findife mangɛ ra yakɔsi?› <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />I nun mangɛ wɔyɛnma tɛmui naxɛ, n fan so tɛmui nan na ki wo yire, n fa i xa wɔyɛnyi rakamali.»<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Batiseba naxa so mangɛ xa konkoe kui. Mangɛ nu bara fori ki fanyi. Abisaga Sunamika nu na mɛɛnife a ma. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batiseba naxa suyidi, a a magoro mangɛ ya i. Mangɛ naxa a maxɔrin, «Munse niyaxi?» <verse eid="1KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Batiseba naxa a yaabi, «N marigi, i bara i kali i Marigi Alatala xili ra, a falafe ra a n ma di nan findima mangɛ ra i ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a dɔxɔ i xa kibanyi kui. <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Kɔnɔ mangɛ n marigi, yakɔsi Adoniya nan fa findife mangɛ ra, a fa li i mu fefe kolon na kui. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />A bara ninge nun yɛxɛɛ turaxi gbegbe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. A bara mangɛ xa die birin xili, fo n ma di Sulemani, naxan findixi i xa konyi fanyi ra. A bara Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Yowaba sɔɔri mangɛ fan xili. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Mangɛ n marigi, Isirayila ɲama tuli matixi i tan nan na, alako i xa a masen naxan dɔxɔma i xa kibanyi kui i ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Xa na mu a ra, i na bɛlɛ tɛmui naxɛ i benbae fɛ ma, yi ɲama fama n tan nun n ma di Sulemani xa fe xun nakanade nɛ alɔ kaafirie.»<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />A wɔyɛn tɛmui, Annabi Natan naxa mangɛ xɔnyi li. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Mixi nde naxa a raso mangɛ xa konkoe kui, a a fala, «Annabi Natan bara fa.» Natan naxa a magoro bɔxi ma mangɛ ya i. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Na tɛmui a naxa a masen mangɛ bɛ, «Mangɛ n marigi, i tan nan a falaxi, ‹Adoniya nan findima mangɛ ra n ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a dɔxɔ n ma kibanyi kui?› <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />N i maxɔrinxi nɛ na ma barima Adoniya ɲan bara ningee nun yɛxɛɛ bɔrɔgɛxi gbegbe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. A bara mangɛ xa die birin, sɔri mangɛe, nun Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xili. E birin na e dɛgefe yire keren, e a falama, ‹Kisi na mangɛ Adoniya bɛ!› <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Kɔnɔ, a mu n tan xilixi, n tan naxan findixi i xa konyi fanyi ra. A mu Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xilixi, a mu Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya xilixi, a mu i xa di Sulemani xilixi, naxan fan findixi i xa konyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Na fe kelixi i tan na ma, mangɛ n marigi? Munfe ra i mu a fala n tan i xa konyi fanyi bɛ, mixi naxan fama dɔxɔde i xa kibanyi kui?»<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxa a fala, «Wo Batiseba xili n bɛ.» A to so mangɛ yire, <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />mangɛ naxa a kali a bɛ, «N bara n kali Alatala ra, naxan n natangaxi n ma tɔɔrɛ birin kui, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />alɔ n nan n kali Alatala ra ki naxɛ a falafe ra, ‹I xa di Sulemani nan findima mangɛ ra n ɲɔxɔɛ ra, a tan nan dɔxɔma n ma kibanyi kui,› to yati n fama nɛ na laayidi rakamalide.» <verse eid="1KI 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Batiseba naxa a magoro, a suyidi mangɛ ya i, a fa a fala «Mangɛ n marigi Dawuda xa kisi abadan!»<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Mangɛ Dawuda naxa a fala a xa mixie bɛ e xa Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, Annabi Natan, nun Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya xili. Nee to fa mangɛ yire, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />a naxa a masen e bɛ, a naxɛ, «Wo xa n ma mixie tongo, wo xa n ma di Sulemani dɔxɔ n ma sofale fari, wo goro a ra Gixon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Mɛnni, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Sadɔki nun Annabi Natan xa ture surusuru a xunyi ma, a tife ra Isirayila mangɛ ra. Wo na gɛ na rabade, wo xa feri fe, wo fa a fala wo xui itexi ra, ‹Kisi na mangɛ Sulemani bɛ!› <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Na tɛmui wo birin xa gbilen, wo xa a dɔxɔ n ma kibanyi kui. A tan nan findima mangɛ ra n ɲɔxɔɛ ra. N bara a ti Isirayila nun Yudaya mangɛ ra.»<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya naxa mangɛ yaabi, «N ma mangɛ, a xa raba na ki! A xa findi i Marigi Alatala sagoe ra! <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Alatala nu na n ma mangɛ bɛ ki naxɛ, a xa lu Sulemani fan bɛ na ki. Sulemani xa mangɛya xa gbo dangi n marigi mangɛ Dawuda gbe ra.»<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, Annabi Natan, Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya, Keretikae, nun Peletakae naxa Sulemani rate mangɛ Dawuda xa sofale fari, e siga a ra Gixon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ naxa so hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a feri tongo ture sɛniyɛnxi nu na naxan kui. A naxa na ture surusuru Sulemani xunyi ma. Na tɛmui e naxa sara fe, ɲama birin naxa a fala e xui itexi ra, «Kisi na mangɛ Sulemani bɛ!» <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Ɲama birin naxa bira a fɔxɔ ra ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. E nu xule fe, e nu e xui ite han bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn na xui ma.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adoniya nun a xa ɲama to gɛ e dɛgɛde, e naxa na xui mɛ. Yowaba to na sara xui mɛ, a naxa a fala, «Sɔnxɔɛ mundun na taa kui na ki?» <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Na tɛmui yati, Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xa di Yonatan naxa so. Adoniya naxa a xili, a naxɛ, «Mixi hagigɛ nan i ra, naxan faxi xibaaru fanyi ra.» <verse eid="1KI 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Kɔnɔ Yonatan naxa Adoniya yaabi, «Won marigi mangɛ Dawuda bara Sulemani ti mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Mangɛ bara Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, Annabi Natan, Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya, Peletakae, nun Keretikae xɛɛ Sulemani matide mangɛ xa sofale fari. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Annabi Natan bara ture sɛniyɛnxi surusuru a xunyi ma Gixon, a xa findi mangɛ ra. E birin bara keli mɛnni sɛɛwɛ kui. Na ɲɛlɛxinyi bara din taa birin na. Wo na xui nan mɛfe yi ki. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Sulemani ɲan bara a magoro mangɛ kibanyi kui. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Mangɛ xa mixie birin bara fa won marigi mangɛ Dawuda yire, e xa duba a bɛ a falafe ra, ‹I Marigi Ala xa Sulemani xili ite dangi i tan na, a xa mangɛya xa gbo dangi i gbe ra!› Mangɛ naxa suyidi a xa sade ma. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />A naxa yi masenyi ti, a naxɛ, ‹Tantui na Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ, naxan mixi nde dɔxɔxi n ma kibanyi kui n ya xɔri.›»<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Adoniya xa mixie a naxee xili, nee birin naxa so sɛrɛnfe gaaxui ra. E naxa keli, kankan naxa siga a xɔnyi. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Adoniya fan naxa gaaxu, a siga hɔrɔmɔlingira, a sɛrɛxɛbade ferie suxu. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Mixi nde naxa a fala Sulemani bɛ a Adoniya to gaaxuxi Sulemani ya ra, a soxi hɔrɔmɔlingira nan kui, a sɛrɛxɛbade ferie suxu, a a fala, «Fo mangɛ Sulemani xa a kali n bɛ to, a mu n tan a xa konyi faxama santidɛgɛma ra.» <verse eid="1KI 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Sulemani naxa yi yaabi fi, a naxɛ, «Xa a sa findi mixi fanyi nan na, sese mu a toma. Kɔnɔ xa a sa findi mixi kobi nan na, a faxama nɛ!» <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Na kui mangɛ Sulemani naxa mixie xɛɛ, e xa a ragoro sɛrɛxɛbade fari. Adoniya naxa siga mangɛ yire, a suyidi a bɛ. Sulemani naxa a fala a bɛ, «Siga i xɔnyi.»<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Dawuda xa ɲungui nun a laaxira tɛmui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Dawuda to a kolon a nu fa na saya kira nan xɔn, a naxa yi masenyi ti a xa di Sulemani bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />«N na saya kira nan xɔn ma yi ki alɔ ibunadama birin. I xa i sɛnbɛ so, i xa ti gben. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />I xa i ɲɔxɔ sa i Marigi Alatala xa yaamarie xɔn ma, i xa bira a xa kira fɔxɔ ra. I xa a xa sɛriyɛ rabatu, i xa a xa yaamarie ratinmɛ. I xa bira a xa lɔnni fɔxɔ ra, i xa a xui suxu alɔ a sɛbɛxi ki naxɛ Tawureta Munsa kui, alako fe birin xa sɔɔnɛya i bɛ i siga dɛdɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />Na nan a toma, Alatala a xa masenyi rakamalima, a naxan masen n bɛ a to a fala, ‹Xa i xa die fe birin nabama alako e xa e ɲɛrɛ n ma kira xɔn e bɔɲɛ birin na, e nii birin na, Isirayila mangɛya luma e yi ra abadan.›»<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />«I a kolon Seruya xa di Yowaba naxan naba n na, i a kolon a naxan naba Isirayila sɔɔrie xa mangɛe, Abeneri, nun Amasa ra. A naxa e faxa bɔɲɛsa waxati, a e wuli maso a xa bɛlɛti nun a xa sankirie ma. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Na kui i xa fɛɛrɛ fen alako a naxa siga aligiyama bɔɲɛsa kui. <verse eid="1KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />I xa i ɲɔxɔ sa Barasilayi Galadika xa die xɔn ma, alako e xa e dɛge i xa teebili ra, barima e na mɔɔli nan naba n bɛ n nu na n gife i taara Abisalomi ma tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />Fo i xa Gera xa di Simeyi Baxurimi xa fe fan mato, naxan fatanxi Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ra. A n danka nɛ a ɲaaxi ra, n nu sigafe Maxanayimi lɔxɔɛ naxɛ. N to gbilen, a naxa n nalan Yurudɛn xure biri. Mɛnni n naxa n kali Alatala ra a n mu a faxama santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Yakɔsi i naxa diɲɛ a ma de. Xaxilima nan i ra, i a kolon a lanma i xa a rasiga aligiyama ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Na tɛmui Dawuda naxa laaxira, a naxa bɛlɛ a benbae fɛ ma a xa taa kui. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />A ɲɛ tongo naani mangɛya nan naba Isirayila xun ma. A naxa ɲɛ solofere raba Xebiron, a ɲɛ tongo saxan nun saxan naba Darisalamu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />A xa di Sulemani naxa magoro a xa kibanyi kui, a xa mangɛya naxa mabanban.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Xagiti xa di Adoniya naxa siga Sulemani nga Batiseba yire. Batiseba naxa a maxɔrin, «I faxi bɔɲɛsa kui?» A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, n faxi bɔɲɛsa kui.» <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Adoniya naxa a fala a bɛ, «N wama wɔyɛn keren nan falafe i bɛ.» Batiseba naxa a yaabi, «Na fala n bɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya naxa yi masenyi ti a bɛ, «I a kolon a nu lanma n tan nan xa findi mangɛ ra. Isirayila birin ya nu rafindixi n tan nan ma n xa findi mangɛ ra. Kɔnɔ Alatala naxa a niya mangɛya xa so n xunya yi ra. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Yakɔsi, n wama fe keren gbansan nan xɔn ma i yi, i naxa tondi n bɛ.» Batiseba naxɛ, «Na fala n bɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Adoniya naxa a fala, «Yandi, i xa a fala mangɛ Sulemani bɛ a xa Abisaga Sunamika fi n ma ginɛ ra. A mu tondima i bɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batiseba naxa a yaabi, «Awa, n wɔyɛnma mangɛ bɛ i xa fe ra.»<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Batiseba naxa siga mangɛ Sulemani yire, a xa sa Adoniya xa fe fala a bɛ. Mangɛ to a nga to, a naxa keli a xa kibanyi, a siga a ralande. A naxa a igoro a nga bɛ, a kibanyi gbɛtɛ maxili. Sulemani nga naxa a magoro a yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Na tɛmui a nga naxa a fala a bɛ, «N wama fe nde nan xɔn. I naxa tondi n bɛ.» Mangɛ naxa a yaabi, «Nga, i xa na fala n bɛ, n mu tondima i bɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />A nga naxa a fala a bɛ, «I xa Abisaga Sunamika fi ginɛ ra i taara Adoniya ma.» <verse eid="1KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa a nga yaabi, «Munfe ra i Abisaga maxɔrinma Adoniya bɛ? Na luxi alɔ i wama n ma mangɛya nan sofe a yi ra, a to findixi n taara ra. I xa a so Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun Seruya xa di Yowaba fan yi ra.»<verse eid="1KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Na kui mangɛ Sulemani naxa a kali Alatala ra, a naxɛ, «Ala xa n xun nakana xa Adoniya mu faxama a xa wɔyɛnyi xa fe ra! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Yakɔsi, n bara n kali Alatala xili ra, naxan n dɔxɔxi n baba Dawuda xa mangɛ kibanyi kui, to yati Adoniya faxama nɛ. N bara n kali Alatala ra naxan n ma fe birin sɔɔnɛyama, naxan bɔnsɔɛ fima n ma.» <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya yamari, a xa sa Adoniya faxa. A raba na ki nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Na dangi xanbi, mangɛ naxa a fala Abiyatari sɛrɛxɛdubɛ bɛ, «Siga i xɔnyi Anatɔti bɔxi ma. A lan i xa faxa, kɔnɔ n bara diɲɛ barima i Ala xa saatɛ kankira xanin nɛ n Baba Dawuda ya i, i man tɔɔrɔ nɛ n baba xa tɔɔrɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Sulemani Abiyatari keri na ki nɛ. Na kui Alatala xa masenyi naxa kamali, Ala naxan masen Eli bɔnsɔɛ xa fe ra Silo.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yowaba nu bara Adoniya mali mangɛ matandide, kɔnɔ a mu nu na Abisalomi tan xa mangɛ matandife kui. Na kui, a to fe mɛ Sulemani naxan naba, a naxa a gi, a siga hɔrɔmɔlingira kui, a sa sɛrɛxɛbade ferie suxu. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Mixie to a fala mangɛ Sulemani bɛ, a Yowaba bara a gi a siga hɔrɔmɔlingira kui sɛrɛxɛbade yire, mangɛ Sulemani naxa Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya yamari, «Sa a faxa!» <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Bɛnaya naxa siga Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira, a a fala a bɛ, «Mangɛ naxɛ i xa mini.» A naxa a yaabi, «N tondi! N xa faxa be!» Bɛnaya naxa sa Yowaba xa wɔyɛnyi dɛntɛgɛ mangɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Mangɛ naxa a fala Bɛnaya bɛ, «I xa a raba alɔ a a falaxi ki naxɛ. I na a faxa, a ragata. Na kui i fama n tan nun n ma denbaya ratangade Yowaba xa wuli raminixi fufafui ma. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Alatala fama na yunubi sare ragbilende a tan nan ma, barima a mixi firin faxa nɛ naxee nu tinxin a tan bɛ, naxee xa fe binyɛ nu dangi a tan gbe ra. N baba Dawuda mu nu a kolon a Neri xa di Abeneri nun Yeteri xa di Amasa, Isirayila sɔɔrie xa mangɛe faxa Yowaba xa santidɛgɛma nan saabui ra. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />E wuli sare dɔxɔma Yowaba nun a bɔnsɔɛ nan xun ma abadan, kɔnɔ Alatala xa hinnɛ nan luma Dawuda, a bɔnsɔɛe, a xa denbaya nun a xa mangɛya ma.» <verse eid="1KI 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Yehoyada xa Bɛnaya naxa siga, a sa Yowaba faxa, a a ragata a xɔnyi gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="1KI 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Mangɛ naxa Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya findi sɔɔrie xa mangɛ ra. A naxa Sadɔki sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ti Abiyatari ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Mangɛ naxa xɛɛra ti Simeyi ma, a a fala a bɛ, «Banxi nde ti Darisalamu, i luma dɛnnaxɛ. I naxa mini taa kui de. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />I na Sediron xure igiri lɔxɔɛ naxɛ minife ra taa kui, i faxama na lɔxɔɛ yati nɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Simeyi naxa mangɛ yaabi, a naxɛ, «Awa yire, i tan n marigi naxan falaxi, n na nan nabama.» Simeyi naxa bu Darisalamu ki fanyi, <verse eid="1KI 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />kɔnɔ ɲɛ saxan to dangi, a xa konyi firin naxa e gi e siga Maaka xa di Akisi xɔnyi, Gati mangɛ. Mixi ndee to a fala a bɛ, «I xa konyi firin na Gati,» <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />a naxa te a xa sofale fari, a siga a xa konyie fɔxɔ ra Gati, Akisi xɔnyi. A to e masɔtɔ, a naxa e ragbilen.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Mixi nde naxa sa na fala mangɛ bɛ, a Simeyi mini nɛ Darisalamu, a siga Gati, a man gbilen. <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />Mangɛ naxa Simeyi xili, a a fala a bɛ, «N mu n kali Alatala ra xɛ i ya xɔri, fa a fala, ‹Xa i mini Darisalamu taa kui, n i faxama nɛ na lɔxɔɛ yati?› I mu a fala xɛ n bɛ a i n xui suxuma nɛ a fanyi ra? <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Munfe ra i mu tin na laayidi rakamalide i naxan tongo Alatala bɛ? Munfe ra i mu n ma yaamari suxu?» <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Mangɛ naxa a fala Simeyi bɛ, «I a kolon i fe ɲaaxi naxan birin naba n baba ra, mangɛ Dawuda, Alatala fama na sare ragbilende i ma, <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />kɔnɔ a bara barakɛ sa mangɛ Sulemani ma. Dawuda xa mangɛya mabanbanxi a fanyi ra Alatala ya i.» <verse eid="1KI 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Na tɛmui mangɛ naxa Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya yamari a xa Simeyi faxa. A naxa na raba. Sulemani xa mangɛya mabanban na ki nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Sulemani xa xaxilimaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:2-13">Yudaya Mangɛe II 1:2-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Sulemani naxa lanyi xiri a tan nun Misira mangɛ firawuna tagi futi ra, a na xa di ginɛ dɔxɔ. A naxa na ginɛ yigiya «Dawuda xa Taa» kui, barima a mu nu gɛxi a xa mangɛ banxi, Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi, nun Darisalamu tɛtɛ tide. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Ɲama nu sɛrɛxɛ bama geyae nan fari, barima Alatala xa banxi mu nu tixi sinden. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Sulemani nu Alatala xanuma, a man nu birama a baba Dawuda xa yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ a fan nu sɛrɛxɛ nun surayi bama geyae nan fari alɔ booree.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Mangɛ naxa siga Gabayon sɛrɛxɛ bade, barima na geya tide nu gbo. Sulemani naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi wulu keren ba mɛnni na sɛrɛxɛbade fari. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Alatala naxa mini Sulemani ma xiye kui Gabayon kɔɛ ra. Ala naxa a fala a bɛ, «I wama fe naxan yo xɔn, a fala n bɛ n xa a fi i ma.» <verse eid="1KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Sulemani naxa a yaabi, a naxɛ, «I bara hinnɛnteya belebele raba i xa konyi n baba Dawuda bɛ, barima a a ɲɛrɛ nɛ i ya i nɔndi ra, tinxinyi ra, nun ɲanige fiixɛ ra. I bara hinnɛ a ra, i di fi a ma, naxan magoroxi a xa kibanyi kui. Na nan a niyaxi n bɛ to. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Yakɔsi, n Marigi Alatala, i tan nan n magoroxi mangɛ kibanyi kui n baba Dawuda ɲɔxɔɛ ra. N luxi alɔ dimɛdi yi mangɛya kui. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />N na i xa ɲama sugandixi tagi, naxan wuya han e kɔnti mu nɔma kɔntide. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Xaxilimaya fi n ma, alako n xa nɔ ɲama raɲɛrɛde a fanyi ra, n xa nɔ fe fanyi nun fe ɲaaxi tagi rasade. Xa na mu, nde fata yi ɲama raɲɛrɛde?»<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Sulemani xa maxandi naxa rafan Marigi ma. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Na kui, Ala naxa a masen Sulemani bɛ, «I to waxi xaxilimaya nan xɔn yi ɲama raɲɛrɛfe ra, i mu simaya xɔnkuye xa maxɔrinxi, i mu bannaya xa maxɔrinxi, i mu i yaxuie faxafe xa maxɔrinxi, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />n bara i xa maxandi suxu. N xaxilimaya fanyi fima nɛ i ma, naxan maniyɛ mu toxi sinden, a man mu toma tɛmuie ma naxee sa fama. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />N bannaya nun binyɛ fima nɛ i ma, naxee maniyɛ mu toma mangɛ gbɛtɛe yi i xa waxati, hali i to mu e maxɔrinxi. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Xa i bira n ma kira fɔxɔ ra, i n ma sɛriyɛ nun n ma yaamari ratinmɛ, alɔ i baba Dawuda a raba ki naxɛ, n i xa simaya ikuyama nɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Na tɛmui Sulemani naxa xunu na xiye ma. A naxa gbilen Darisalamu Alatala xa saatɛ kankira yire. A naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe ba, a fa na don a tan nun a xa mixie birin na.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Langoe ginɛ firin naxa siga mangɛ yire kiiti fenfe ra a yi. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Na ginɛ nde naxa a fala a bɛ, a naxɛ, «N marigi i xa i haakɛ to n bɛ. N nun yi ginɛ, muxu birin nan na banxi keren kui. N naxa di bari a ya xɔri. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Xi saxan to dangi, a fan naxa di bari. Muxu doro nan tun nu a ra, mixi gbɛtɛ yo mu nu na banxi kui fo muxu firin peti. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Kɔɛ nde kui, yi ginɛ naxa a sa a xa di fari, a xa di naxa faxa. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />A to na to, a naxa n ma di tongo n sɛɛti ma, a fa a xa di faxaxi sa n tan fɛ ma. N nu xife, n mu nu na sese kolon. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Gɛɛsɛgɛ n to keli n xa xiɲɛ fi n ma di ma, n naxa a to na di bara faxa. Kɔnɔ n to a igbɛ fa a fanyi ra, n naxa a to n ma di mu a ra, n naxan barixi.»<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Boore ginɛ naxa wɔyɛnyi tongo, a a fala, «A mu na na ki xɛ. N ma di nan baloxi, i tan nan xa di faxaxi.» Ginɛ singe naxa boore matandi a falafe ra, «I wule! N ma di xa mu faxaxi, n gbe nan baloxi.» E nu wɔyɛnma na ki nɛ mangɛ ya xɔri. <verse eid="1KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Na kui mangɛ naxa yi masenyi ti e bɛ, «Nde naxɛ, ‹N ma di nan baloxi, i gbe nan faxaxi.› Boore naxɛ, ‹I wule. N gbe nan baloxi, i gbe nan faxaxi.›»<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Na wɔyɛnyi dangi xanbi, mangɛ naxa mixie yamari, «Wo fa santidɛgɛma ra n bɛ ba.» E to fa na santidɛgɛma ra a xɔn ma, <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo yi diyɔrɛ baloxi ibolon a tagi, wo sɛɛti nde so yi ginɛ yi ra, wo boore sɛɛti so na boore ginɛ yi ra.»<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Na tɛmui ginɛ naxan xa di baloxi, na bɔɲɛ naxa a xaba a xa di xa fe xanunteya xafe ra, han a a fala mangɛ bɛ, «Yandi, n bara i maxandi n marigi, wo di baloxi so a yi ra, wo naxa yi di faxa.» Kɔnɔ boore ginɛ tan naxa a fala, «Yi di naxa lu n yi ra, a naxa lu i fan yi ra. Wo a ibolon!» <verse eid="1KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Mangɛ to na mɛ, a naxa a masen, «Wo naxa diyɔrɛ faxa. Wo xa yi di baloxi so na ginɛ singe yi ra, a nga nan na ki.»<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Isirayila ɲama to mangɛ xa kiiti mɛ, e naxa gaaxu a ya ra, barima e nu bara a kolon Ala xaxili nan na a bɔɲɛ ma mangɛya raɲɛrɛfe ra tinxinyi kui.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Sulemani xa kuntigi xungbee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu Isirayila bɔxi birin yamarima. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />A xa kuntigi xungbee nan yi ki:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:2">Sadɔki xa di Asaraya, naxan findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Sifa xa di Elixorefa nun Ahiya, naxee findi sɛbɛlitie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:3">Axiludu xa di Yehosafati, naxan findi kɛɛdi ragatɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Yehoyada xa di Bɛnaya, naxan findi sɔɔrie xa mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:4">Sadɔki nun Abiyatari, naxee findi sɛrɛxɛdubɛe ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Natan xa di Asariyahu, naxan findi gominae xa mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:5">Natan xa di Sabadi, naxan findi mangɛ xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahisari, naxan findi mangɛ xa banxi walikɛe xunyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:6">Abeda xa di Adonirami, naxan findi konyie xunyi ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu bara gomina fu nun firin ti Isirayila bɔxi xun ma. Kike yo kike ɲɛ kui, gomina keren nu fama baloe ra mangɛ nun a xa denbaya bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />E xilie nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:8">Xuru xa di, naxan nu gomina ra Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa geya bɔxi xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Dekeri xa di, naxan nu gomina ra Makasa, Saalabimi, Beti Semesi, Elon, nun Beti Hanan taae xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Xeseda xa di, naxan nu gomina ra Arubotu, Soko, nun Xeferi bɔxi xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Abinadabo xa di, naxan nu gomina ra Dɔrɔ bɔxi xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:11">naxan mangɛ Sulemani xa di ginɛ Tafati dɔxɔ.<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Axiludu xa di Bana, naxan nu gomina ra Taanaki, Megido, nun Beti Saan xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:12">dɛnnaxɛ na Saratan sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:12">A tan nan nu gomina ra Yisireeli fan xun ma, kelife Beti Saan han Abeli Mexola, han Yokineyami xanbi ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Geberi xa di, naxan nu gomina ra Ramoti, Galadi bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:13">A tan nan nu gomina ra Manasi xa di Yayiri xa taae xun ma, Galadi bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:13">A tan nan nu gomina ra na bɔxi xun ma, kelife Aragobo han Basan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:13">taa xungbe makantaxi tongo senni nu na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ido xa di Axinadabo nan nu gomina ra Maxanayimi xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Aximaasi nan nu gomina ra Nafatali bɔxi xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:15">naxan mangɛ Sulemani xa di ginɛ Basamati dɔxɔ.<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Xusayi xa di Bana nan nu gomina ra Aseri nun Beyaloti xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Paruwa xa di Yehosafati nan nu gomina ra Isakari bɔxi xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Ela xa di Simeyi nan nu gomina ra Bunyamin bɔxi xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Uri xa di Geberi nan nu gomina ra Galadi bɔxi xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:19">a Amorikae xa mangɛ Sixɔn xa bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:19">nun Basankae xa mangɛ Ogo xa bɔxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 4:19">Geberi keren nan nu na bɔxi birin gomina ra.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Yudayakae nun Isirayilakae nu wuya alɔ baa dɛ ra mɛyɛnyi. E nu e dɛgema, e nu e minma sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="1KI 4:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Sulemani xa mangɛya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 2:1-16">Yudaya Mangɛe II 2:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu bɔxi birin yamarima, kelife Efirati xure ma, han Filisita bɔxi, han Misira naaninyi ra. Na mixi birin nu duuti fima mangɛ Sulemani ma a xa simaya birin kui.<verse eid="1KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Mangɛ Sulemani nun a xa mixie baloe findi yi nan na lɔxɔɛ keren kui: farin fuɲi daaxi busali kɛmɛ tongo saxan, ɲɔɛraba busali kɛmɛ firin tongo naani, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />ninge bɔrɔgɛxi fu, ninge dɛmadon daaxi mɔxɔɲɛn, xuruse lanma kɛmɛ, bolee, xelie, burunyi sie, nun xɔni bɔrɔgɛxie.<verse eid="1KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Mangɛ Sulemani nan nu bɔxi birin yamarima naxee nu na Efirati xure yirefanyi ma, kelife Tifisa han Gasa. Na bɔxi mangɛe nun e xa mixie nu sabatixi bɔɲɛsa nan kui. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Yudayakae nun Isirayilakae birin, kelife Dana han Beriseeba, nu sabatixi bɔɲɛsa nan kui e xa wɛni bilie nun e xa xɔrɛ bilie tagi Sulemani xa mangɛya bun ma.<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Soe gɔɔrɛ wulu tongo naani nu na Sulemani yi ra, naxee nu a xa sɔɔri ragisee bɛndunma. Soe ragi mixi wulu fu nun firin nan nu na Sulemani yi ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Sulemani xa gomina fu nun firinyie nu fama baloe ra a bɛ nun a xa mixie bɛ. Kike yo kike gomina nde nu fama mangɛ hayi birin na. <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />E nu fama mɛngi nun sɛxɛ ra soe birin bɛ gɔɔrɛe kui.<verse eid="1KI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Ala xaxilimaya, lɔnni, nun fahaamui gbegbe nan so Sulemani yi ra. E nu gbo alɔ baa dɛ ra mɛyɛnyi. <verse eid="1KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Sulemani xa xaxilimaya nu dangi fugerakae nun Misirakae xa xaxilimaya birin na. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />A xa xaxilimaya nu dangi mixi birin na, hali Etani Esiraka, Maxolo xa die Heman, Kalikɔli, nun Darada. A xili naxa din bɔxi birin na naxee nu Isirayila rabilinyi. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />A taali wulu saxan nan fala, a nun bɛɛti wulu keren nun suuli. <verse eid="1KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />A wuri gbegbee xa fe fala, a fɔlɔfe Liban wuri xungbe ma naxan xili sɛdiri, a sa hisopi sansi xunxuri li naxan bulama banxi xalɛ ma. A subee, xɔnie, bubusee, nun yɛxɛe fan xa fe fala. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Duniɲa mangɛe nu luma mixie xɛɛ ra e xa fa mangɛ Sulemani xa lɔnni nun xaxilimaya ramɛ.<verse eid="1KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Tire mangɛ Xirami naxa kuntigie xɛɛ mangɛ Sulemani xɔn, barima a nu bara a mɛ a a tan nan tixi mangɛ ra a baba ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Xirami nu bara Sulemani baba Dawuda xanu kabi a rakuya. <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />Sulemani naxa Xirami yaabi, <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />«I nu n baba Dawuda kolon, a mu nɔ banxi tide a Marigi Alatala bɛ gere xa fe ra, naxan nu na a yire birin han Alatala naxa a yaxuie sa a sanyi bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Yakɔsi Alatala bara a ragiri n xa lu bɔɲɛsa kui. Gere nun fe xɔnɛ bara ɲɔn. <verse eid="1KI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 5:19" />Na kui n bara a ɲanige n xa banxi ti n Marigi Alatala bɛ alɔ a a yitaxi ki naxɛ n baba Dawuda bɛ. A naxa a masen a bɛ, ‹I xa di, n naxan dɔxɔma i xa kibanyi kui i ɲɔxɔɛ ra, na nan fama banxi tide n bɛ.› <verse eid="1KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 5:20" />I naxan nabama, i xa yaamari fi Liban sɛdiri wuyaxie xa xaba n bɛ. N ma walikɛe kafuma nɛ i xa walikɛe ma. N e xa wali sare fima nɛ alɔ i wama a xɔn ki naxɛ. Mixi yo mu na naxan fata wuri xabade alɔ Sidɔnkae.»<verse eid="1KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 5:21" />Mangɛ Xirami to Sulemani xa wɔyɛnyi mɛ, a naxa sɛɛwa ki fanyi ra, a fa a fala, «Alatala tantu. A bara di xaxilima fi Dawuda ma naxan nɔma yi ɲama xungbe raɲɛrɛde.» <verse eid="1KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 5:22" />Xirami naxa Sulemani yaabi, a naxɛ, «N bara i xa masenyi mɛ. N i waxɔnfe birin nabama nɛ, sɛdiri wurie nun sipirɛ wurie xa fe ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 5:23" />N ma walikɛe wurie ragoroma nɛ kelife Liban han baa dɛ ra. N e xirima e boore ra, alako n xa e raɲɛrɛ baa fari han i wama dɛnnaxɛ xɔn. Mɛnni n e rafulunma, i fa e xanin. N tan wama naxan xɔn na wali sare ra, i xa baloe fi n tan nun n ma mixie ma.»<verse eid="1KI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 5:24" />Mangɛ Xirami naxa sɛdiri wuri nun sipirɛ wuri birin so mangɛ Sulemani yi ra, a nu wama naxan xɔn. <verse eid="1KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 5:25" />Ɲɛ yo ɲɛ, mangɛ Sulemani nu farin busali wulu tongo solomasaxan nun ture fifa mɔxɔɲɛn fima nɛ Xirami ma a xa banxi baloe xa fe ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 5:26" />Alatala xaxilimaya fi nɛ Sulemani ma alɔ a a fala a bɛ ki naxɛ. Dɛfanyi naxa lu Xirami nun Sulemani tagi, e fa saatɛ xiri e boore bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 5:27" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa Isirayilaka wulu tongo saxan yamari e xa wali a bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 5:28" />Kike yo kike, a naxa mixi wulu fu rasiga Liban bɔxi ma, e xa wali kike keren mɛnni, e fa kike firin naba e xɔnyi. Adonirami nan nu na na fe xunyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 5:29" />Mixi wulu tongo solofere nan nu kote maxaninma, mixi wulu tongo solomasaxan nan nu gɛmɛ masolima mangɛ Sulemani bɛ geyae kɔn na Liban. <verse eid="1KI 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 5:30" />Sulemani xa gominae nu bara mixi wulu saxan kɛmɛ saxan sugandi naxee nu wali xun matoma a ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 5:31" />Mangɛ nu bara yaamari fi, a walikɛe xa gɛmɛ xungbe tofanyie masoli naxee findima Ala xa banxi sanbunyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 5:32" />Sulemani nun Xirami xa banxitie nun Gebalakae naxa gɛmɛe masoli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 5:32">Wurie nun gɛmɛe yailan na ki nɛ Ala xa banxi xa fe ra.<verse eid="1KI 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi tife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Ɲɛ kɛmɛ naani ɲɛ tongo solomasaxan to dangi kelife Isirayila mini Misira bɔxi ra tɛmui naxɛ, mangɛ Sulemani naxa Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti fɔlɔ Siwi kike kui. Na ɲɛ findixi a xa mangɛya ɲɛ naani nde nan na Isirayila bɔxi xun ma. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Sulemani Ala xa banxi ti yi maniyɛ xasabi nan na: A kuyɛ ɲɔngɔn ya tongo senni, a gboe ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn, a ite ɲɔngɔn ya tongo saxan. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />A yatagi buntunyi xa kuyɛ nu lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nan ma, alɔ banxi xa kuyɛ na ki naxɛ. A gboe fan findi ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn nan na.<verse eid="1KI 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />A wundɛrie nu yailanxi banxi xalɛ nan kui, wurie fan nu yailanxi e fari. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />A naxa konkoe fatu hɔrɔmɔbanxi xalɛ rabilinyi. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Konkoe singee xa gboe nu lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya suuli nan ma. Nee fari konkoe gbɛtɛe naxa dɔxɔ naxee xa gboe nu lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya senni ma. Nee fan fari konkoe gbɛtɛe naxa dɔxɔ naxee xa gboe nu lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya solofere ma. Hɔrɔmɔbanxi xalɛ xa marabinye nu raxurunxi a fuge biri ra, alako konkoee masa wurie mu soma banxi xalɛ kui ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />E to nu hɔrɔmɔbanxi tima, e nu gɛmɛe rawalima naxee ɲan nu bara masoli geya yire e tongoxi dɛnnaxɛ. Na ki walise yo xui mu nu mɛma hɔrɔmɔbanxi yire, alɔ dɛrɛma, bera, xa na mu a ra walise gbɛtɛ naxan yailanxi wure ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Naadɛ nde nu na banxi yirefanyi ma naxan minima konkoee yire ma. Tede samɛ daaxi nde nu yailanxi banxi kui ma, naxan nu konkoee kui masɔtɔma koore ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />E to gɛ banxi tide, Sulemani naxa a raxunma sɛdiri wurie ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Konkoe naxee nu tixi hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛɛtie ma, e ite ɲɔngɔn ya suuli. Na birin nu xirixi banxi ma sɛdiri wurie ra.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Alatala naxa a masen mangɛ Sulemani bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />«N xa a fala i bɛ yi banxi tife xa fe ra, xa i sa i ɲɛrɛ n ma kira xɔn ma, xa i sa n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu, xa i sa n ma yaamarie suxu, n nan n ma laayidi rakamalima nɛ i bɛ, n naxan fala i baba Dawuda bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Na kui n luma nɛ n ma ɲama tagi, n mu i bɛɲinma abadan.»<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Sulemani naxa Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ti, a wali raɲɔn. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />A naxa sɛdiri wuri xebenyie mafatu banxi xalɛe ma a kui, kelife a xalɛ fɔlɛ ma han banxi xunyi ra. A naxa sipirɛ wuri xebenyie mafatu banxi gbaata ma. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />A naxa sɛdiri wuri xebenyie mafatu konkoe ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn daaxi ma banxi kui dunxui ra, kelife a gbaata ma han fuge. Na nu findixi Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante nan na. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Banxi palaa dɔnxɔɛ naxan nu na na yatagi, nu kuya ɲɔngɔn ya tongo naani. Na nu findixi Yire Sɛniyɛnxi nan na. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Sɛdiri wuri xebenyie naxee nu fatuxi banxi xalɛe ma palaa ma, sansi bogie nun sansi fugee fan nu masolixi e ma. Na ki, gɛmɛ mu nu toma banxi kui ma fefe ma.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Sulemani naxa Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante yailan hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, Alatala xa saatɛ kankira dɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Na yire kuya ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn, a igbo ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn, a ite ɲɔngɔn ya mɔxɔɲɛn. Xɛɛma nu masoxi na konkoe xalɛe birin ma, a nun sɛrɛxɛbade ma naxan yailanxi sɛdiri wuri ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa xɛɛma maso na Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante xalɛe ma. A naxa yɔlɔnxɔnyi xunxuri xɛɛma daaxie gbaku naa sode dɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Ba na ra, a nu bara xɛɛma maso na hɔrɔmɔbanxi xalɛe birin ma, a nun sɛrɛxɛbade ma naxan nu na naa.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />A naxa malekɛ firin misaali masoli wulai oliwi wuri ra. E ite ɲɔngɔn ya fu. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Malekɛ singe gabutenyi keren xa kuyɛ ɲɔngɔn ya suuli, a gabutenyi firin nde fan xa kuyɛ ɲɔngɔn ya suuli, naxan lanma nɔngɔn fu ma kelife a kɔɔla ma han a yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Boore malekɛ fan gbee lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya fu nan ma. E firinyi nu yailanxi kɛɲa keren nan na. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />E firinyi ite ɲɔngɔn ya fu. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Sulemani naxa na malekɛe ti Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante tagi, alako malekɛe gabutenyie xa banxi xalɛe li, e fan xa e boore li banxi tagi. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Sulemani naxa xɛɛma maso na malekɛ firinyie birin ma.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />A naxa yaamari fi, a e xa malekɛe, tugi bilie, nun wuri fuge tofanyi misaalie masoli banxi xalɛe ma, naxee nu na Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante nun Yire Sɛniyɛnxi kui. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />A naxa xɛɛma maso banxi gbaata ma na yire firinyie kui. <verse eid="1KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />A naxa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa naadɛe yailan wulai oliwi wuri ra. A e gbaku oliwi wuri xebenyie ra naxee xa marabinye mu nu banxi xalɛ gbe lima, fo dɔxɔ naani. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Na naadɛ firinyie nu yailanxi wulai oliwi wuri nan na. Malekɛ, tugi bili, nun wuri fuge tofanyie misaalie nu masolixi na naadɛe ma. Xɛɛma nu masoxi na naadɛe nun na misaalie ma <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />A naxa na mɔɔli raba naadɛe ma naxee nu na Yire Sɛniyɛnxi ma. E yailanxi oliwi wuri ra, e gbakuxi wuri xebenyie ra naxee mu nu banxi xalɛ xa marabinye lima fo dɔxɔ saxan. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Naadɛ firinyi gbɛtɛ nu yailanxi sipirɛ wuri ra. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />A naxa yaamari fi e xa malekɛe, tugie, nun sansi fuge tofanyi misaalie masoli e ma. Na dangi xanbi a naxa xɛɛma maso naadɛe nun na misaalie ma.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />A naxa buntunyi yailan gɛmɛ masolixie ra, naxee nu dɔxɔxi safɛ saxan na, a nun sɛdiri wuri safɛ keren na.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Alatala xa banxi dɔxɔ fɔlɔ Siwi kike nan na, Sulemani xa mangɛya ɲɛ naani nde. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />A naxa ɲɔn Bulu kike ra, kike solomasaxan nde, Sulemani xa mangɛya ɲɛ fu nun keren nde. Na banxi birin ti ɲɛ solofere nan bun ma, a fa lu alɔ Ala nu wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ banxi tife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Sulemani bu nɛ ɲɛ fu nun saxan a yɛtɛ xa banxie tife ra. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />A banxi naxan singe ti a a xili sa nɛ «Liban fɔtɔnyi banxi.» A nu kuya ɲɔngɔn ya kɛmɛ, a igbo ɲɔngɔn ya tongo suuli, a ite ɲɔngɔn ya tongo saxan. A xunyi wurie nu dɔxɔxi kinki safɛ naani naxee xun, nee nu yailanxi sɛdiri wuri nan na. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Na kinkie fari nu makotoxi sɛdiri xebenyi tongo naani nun suuli nan na a safɛ ki ma, fu nun suuli safɛ keren. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Banxi sɛɛtie ma, wundɛri safɛ saxan nu na e ma, e ya rafindixi e boore ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Naadɛ saxan fan nu na wundɛrie ya tagi. <verse eid="1KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Buntunyi nu na naxan xa kuyɛ ɲɔngɔn ya tongo suuli lima, a igboe ɲɔngɔn ya tongo saxan. <verse eid="1KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Banxi pala naxan fan nu yailanxi sɛdiri wuri ra keli a gbata ma han fuge, nan nu findixi a xa kiiti sade ra.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />A banxi gbɛtɛ ti nɛ na xanbi ra a nu luma dɛnnaxɛ. A a yailan alɔ boore. Na xanbi ra, a naxa banxi gbɛtɛ ti Firawuna xa di ginɛ bɛ a naxan dɔxɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Nee birin ti gɛmɛ masolixie nan na naxee xabaxi sɛra ra a kui nun a fari, kelife a bunyi ma han fuge. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Banxi sanbunyi dɔxɔ gɛmɛ tofanyi xungbee nan na, naxee xabaxi ɲɔngɔn ya fu xa na mu a ra ɲɔngɔn ya solomasaxan ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />A fuge ra, sɛdiri wuri nun gɛmɛ tofanyie nu na naxee xabaxi a fanyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Na tɛtɛ xungbe nu yailanxi gɛmɛ xabaxi safɛ saxan na, sɛdiri wuri fan nu saxi na fari, alɔ Alatala xa banxi nun a gbutunyi.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa mixi nde fen Tire, naxan xili Xirami. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Kaaɲɛ ginɛ nde xa di nan nu a ra fatanfe Nafatali bɔnsɔɛ ra. Tireka nan nu a Baba ra, naxan nu wure gbeeli rawalima. A lɔnnixi, a xaxili fan, a fata wure gbeeli rawalide a mɔɔli birin na. A siga nɛ mangɛ Sulemani yire, a na wali mɔɔli raba.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />A kinki firin xabu wure gbeeli ra, naxee ite ɲɔngɔn ya fu nun solomasaxan, naxee xa radigilinyi lanxi ɲɔngɔn ya fu nun firin ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />A xunyi firin xabu na kinki firinyie bɛ, naxee ite ɲɔngɔn ya suuli. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />A se raxunmase fu nun naani xabu na xunyi firinyie bɛ, xunyi keren solofere. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />A mangoe bogi maniyɛe yailan safɛ firin na na se raxunmase radɔxɔxi firinyie ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />A fuge maniyɛe masoli na kinki xunyi firinyie ma naxee nu na buntunyi ra. E ite ɲɔngɔn ya naani. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />A mangoe bogi maniyɛe kɛmɛ firin masoli na kinki xunyi firinyie ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />A na kinkie ti buntunyi ya tagi. Naxan nu na a yirefanyi ma, a xili naxa sa Yakin, naxan nu na a kɔɔla ma, na xili naxa sa Boosu. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Na kinkie konde ra, fugee nu masolixi mɛnnie ma.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />A naxa ye sase xungbe digilinxi yailan yɔxui ra. A dɛ igboe ɲɔngɔn ya fu, a ite ɲɔngɔn ya suuli, a xa radigilinyi ɲɔngɔn ya tongo saxan. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Na ye sase dɛ rabilinyi bunyi, ninge maniyɛ nu masolixi a ma e radɔxɔxi e boore ra a rabilinyi birin ma. Ninge fu na ɲɔngɔn ya keren ma, suuli a fari, suuli a bun. Ningee yo, ye sase yo, na birin yailanxi kerenyi nan na.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Na ye sase nu dɔxɔxi ninge maniyɛ gbɛtɛ fu nun firin fari. Saxan ya rafindixi kɔɔla biri, saxan ya rafindixi sogegorode biri, saxan ya rafindixi yirefanyi biri, saxan ya rafindixi sogetede biri. Na ye sase naxan nu xili «Baa» nu dɔxɔxi na ningee fari, e ya rafindixi tande ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Na ye sase xa marabinye nu findixi suxu keren nan na. A dɛ kiri masolixi maniyɛ sansi fuge tofanyi ra. Ye fifa kɛmɛ solofere fifa tongo suuli nu nɔma sade a kui.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />A naxa e sanbunyi fu yailan. E birin nu kuya ɲɔngɔn ya naani, e igbo ɲɔngɔn ya naani, a ite ɲɔngɔn ya saxan. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />E na sanbunyie rafala ki naxɛ, wure ralɛnfɛtɛnxie nu na wure gbɛtɛ naani tagi. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Yɛtɛ misaalie, ninge misaalie, nun malekɛ misaalie nu yailanxi na wure ralɛnfɛtɛnxie ma, a nun pirinti gbɛtɛe. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Wure digilinxi naani nu na sanbunyi keren keren ma bɛ a ti se ra, naxee nu xirixi e boore ra wure gbeeli firin na. Wure nde nu na na tuxui naanie ma ye sase bun ma. Na birin nu yailanxi tɛmui kerenyi nan na. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Se digilinxi nde nu na ye sase nu dɔxɔxi naxan kui. Na ite ɲɔngɔn ya keren sanbunyi bɛ, a igbo ɲɔngɔn ya keren nun a tagi. Se ndee nu masolixi na ma. Na wure ralɛnfɛtɛnxie mu nu digilinxi, e sɛɛti naanie birin xa maniyɛ nu lan. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Na wure digilinxi naani naxee nu na a ye maxanin se tuxui naanie ra, e ite ɲɔngɔn ya keren nun a tagi, firin nu xirixi e boore ra wure gbeeli ra. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Na wure digilinxie maniyɛ sɔɔri ragise sanyie ra. E birin nu yailanxi wure gbeeli ra tɛmui kerenyi ra.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Se nde nu na tuxui naanie birin na naxee nu sɛnbɛ fima e ma. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Se digilinxi nde nu na ye sase dɔxɔde kui. Na ite sanbunyi bɛ ɲɔngɔn ya keren. Sanbunyie fuge, a kilɔndee nun a wure ralɛnfɛtɛnxie birin nu yailanxi wure gbeeli nan na tɛmui kerenyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Malekɛ misaalie, yɛtɛ misaalie, nun tugi misaalie nu yailanxi na kebelae ma, nun se gbɛtɛe. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Ye maxanin se fu nu yailanxi ki kerenyi ra na ki nɛ wure gbeeli ra. E birin nu lan.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Xirami ye sase fu yailan nɛ wure gbeeli ra, naxee nu dɔxɔxi na ye maxanin se fu fari. Ye litiri wulu keren kɛmɛ senni ɲɔndɔn nu sama kankan kui. Ye sase nu igbo ɲɔngɔn ya naani. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />A naxa ye maxanin see dɔxɔ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɛɛtie ma, suuli kɔɔla biri, suuli yirefanyi biri. Na ye sase belebele naxan nu xili «Baa,» a naxa na dɔxɔ banxi yirefanyi ma, a makɔrɛ a sogetede biri ra. <verse eid="1KI 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Xurami naxa ye sasee, tɛ xube kɔ see nun tundee yailan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Na kui, Xurami naxa gɛ mangɛ Sulemani xa walie ra Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra. Na walie nan ya: <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />kinki firinyie, e xunyi tofanxie, se raxunmase naxee e fari, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />kɔɔbɛ bogi maniyɛ kɛmɛ naani gbakuxi e ra, kɔɔbɛ bogi maniyɛ safɛ firin se raxunmase keren ma kinkie xunyi ra, <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />sunbui maxanin se fu, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />ye sase xungbe naxan xili «Baa,» ninge fu nun firin misaali naxee na ye sase xungbe bun ma, <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />tundee, pelie, paanie. Xurami se naxee birin yailan mangɛ Sulemani bɛ Alatala xa banxi xa fe ra, a e yailan wure gbeeli raxunuxi nan na. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Mangɛ nu na yɔxui raxunu Yurudɛn mɛrɛ yire nɛ, Sukɔti nun Saratan tagi. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Mangɛ Sulemani na birin yailan wure gbeeli nan na, naxan xa gboe xasabi mu nu nɔma kolonde.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Sulemani se gbegbe yailan nɛ Ala xa banxi bɛ, alɔ sɛrɛxɛbade xɛɛma daaxi, teebili xɛɛma daaxi nde taami sɛrɛxɛ sama dɛnnaxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />lanpui dɔxɔ se xɛɛma daaxie naxee dɛxɛma Yire Sɛniyɛnxi kui sɛriyɛ ki ma, a fuge misaalixie, lanpuie, tɛ xube kɔ se xɛɛma daaxie, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />paanie, finɛe, pɔɔti tofanyie, piletie, kolopɔɔti xɛɛma fanyi daaxie, Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa naadɛe gbaku se xɛɛma daaxie, naxee nu na Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante sode dɛ ra nun hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Sulemani Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa see yailan xɛɛma ra na ki nɛ. A to gɛ na ra, a naxa se birin naso Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa naafuli ragatade kui, a baba Dawuda naxee fixi Ala ma.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Saatɛ kankira dɔxɔfe hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:11">Yudaya Mangɛe II 5:2-6:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Na tɛmui, Sulemani naxa Isirayila forie, bɔnsɔɛ xunyie, nun Isirayila denbaya xunyie maxili alako e xa te Alatala xa saatɛ kankira ra kelife Siyon, Dawuda xa taa. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Isirayilaka birin naxa e malan mangɛ yire alako e xa kike solofere sali raba. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Isirayila forie birin to mɛnni li, Lewikae naxa saatɛ kankira tongo, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />e a xanin a nun Ala xa Naralande Kiri banxi, a nun se sɛniyɛnxi naxee nu na a kui. Lewika sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nan na wali raba.<verse eid="1KI 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Mangɛ Sulemani nun Isirayila ɲama naxee birin nu maxilixi, naxa ti saatɛ kankira ya ra. E naxa xuruse lanmae nun a xungbe gbegbe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra, naxan kɔnti mu nu nɔma kolonde. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe naxa Alatala xa saatɛ kankira dɔxɔ a dɔxɔde Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi, Yire Sɛniyɛnxi Fisamante kui. E a dɔxɔ malekɛe gabutenyie bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Malekɛe gabutenyie nu italaxi saatɛ kankira nun a maxanin see xun ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Saatɛ kankira maxanin see findixi wuri kuyee nan na, naxee ɲɔɛe nu toma kafi pala ma yire sɛniyɛnxi kui, kɔnɔ e mu nu nɔma tode hɔrɔmɔbanxi tande tan ma. Han to saatɛ kankira na mɛnni. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Sese mu nu na na saatɛ kankira kui, fo na walaxɛ firinyi Annabi Munsa naxee sa a kui. A na raba Xorebe geya yire nɛ, Alatala saatɛ xiri lɔxɔɛ e nun Isirayilakae tagi, e mini tɛmui Misira.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe to mini Yire Sɛniyɛnxi kui, nuxui nde naxa goro Alatala xa banxi ma, a a rafe. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛe mu nɔ lude mɛnni e xa e xa wali raba, barima na nuxui nu na naa, Alatala xa nɔrɛ nu bara lu banxi birin ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Na kui, Sulemani naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">«Alatala a masen nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">a a sabatima nuxui fɔɔrɛ nan kui.<verse eid="1KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Na kui n bara lingira ti i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:13">i sabatima dɛnnaxɛ abadan.»<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Mangɛ naxa a ya rafindi, a duba Isirayila ɲama birin bɛ. E birin nu tixi. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />A naxa a masen, «Tantui na Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ, naxan wɔyɛn n baba Dawuda bɛ a kɛrɛ ra. A fe naxan birin masen a bɛ, a na birin nakamalixi nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />A naxɛ, ‹Kafi n nan n ma ɲama ramini Misira bɔxi ra, n mu nu taa sugandixi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe tagi n banxi tima dɛnnaxɛ. N man mu xɛmɛ sugandixi naxan findima n ma Isirayila ɲama yarerati ra. Kɔnɔ n bara Darisalamu nan sugandi alako n xili xa lu naa. N man bara Dawuda sugandi alako a xa findi n ma Isirayila ɲama xunyi ra.›»<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />«N baba Dawuda naxa natɛ tongo a bɔɲɛ kui, a fo a xa banxi ti Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Alatala naxa a fala n baba Dawuda bɛ, ‹I to natɛ tongo i bɔɲɛ kui n ma banxi xa fe ra, na bara findi ɲanige fanyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Kɔnɔ i tan xa mu na banxi tima. I xa di nan na tima. I naxan barixi, na nan n ma banxi tima.› <verse eid="1KI 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />Alatala bara a xa masenyi rakamali. N tan bara ti n baba Dawuda ɲɔxɔɛ ra Isirayila mangɛ kibanyi kui, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ. N man bara banxi ti Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />N bara Alatala xa saatɛ kankira dɔxɔ naa, a xa saatɛ walaxɛ na na kui. A na saatɛ xiri a nun Isirayilakae nan tagi.»<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa ti sɛrɛxɛbade ya i ɲama birin ya xɔri, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ itala koore ma, a fa a fala, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />«Isirayila Marigi Alatala, i maniyɛ mu na koore nun bɔxi ma. I dugutɛgɛxi i xa saatɛ nun i xa hinnɛ xa fe nan na i xa konyie mabiri, naxee ɲɛrɛma i ya tode ra e bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Na na a ra, to lɔxɔɛ i bara i xa laayidi rakamali i xa konyi n baba Dawuda bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Yakɔsi, Isirayila Marigi Alatala, i laayidi naxan tongoxi i xa konyi n baba Dawuda bɛ, i xa na rakamali. I bara a masen a bɛ, ‹Xa i bɔnsɔɛ fɛntɛn e ɲɛrɛ ki ma alɔ i a rabaxi ki naxɛ, e naxa n ma sɛriyɛ binya, mixi nde na e bɔnsɔɛ ya ma naxan fama lude Isirayila kibanyi kui abadan.› <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Yakɔsi, Isirayila Marigi Alatala, i xa i xa masenyi rakamali, i naxan masen i xa konyi Dawuda bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />«Kɔnɔ Ala tan nɔma sabatide duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari adamadie tagi? Koore nun a xa gboe xurun i bɛ. N banxi naxan tixi i bɛ a xurun koore bɛ. I luma mɛnni di? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />N Marigi Alatala, i xa i xa konyi xa dubɛ suxu, i xa a xa maxandi tongo, i xa i tuli mati i xa konyi wa xui ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />I xa i ɲɛngi sa yi banxi xɔn ma kɔɛ nun yanyi ra, barima i xili matɔxɔma be. I xa i xa konyi xa maxandi suxu yi banxi kui. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />I xa i tuli mati i xa konyi nun i xa ɲama wa xui ra, e i maxandima be tɛmui naxɛ. Kelife koore ma i dɔxɔxi dɛnnaxɛ, i xa i tuli mati muxu ra, i man xa diɲɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />«Xa mixi nde sa yunubi raba a boore ra, e fa a fala a bɛ a xa kali nde ti sɛrɛxɛbade yire yi banxi kui, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma, i xa kiiti sa nɔndi ra alako fe kanɛ nun tinxintɔɛ birin xa e sare sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />«Xa i xa ɲama Isirayila sa yunubi raba i ra, e yaxuie fa nɔ e ra na xa fe ra, xa e bara tin gbilenfe ra i yire, e i xili matɔxɔ, e i maxandi yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma, i xa i xa ɲama Isirayila xa yunubie xafari, i fa e ragbilen bɔxi ma, i dɛnnaxɛ fixi e tan nun e babae ma.»<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />«Xa koore sa balan, tunɛ yo mu fa, barima e bara yunubi raba i ra, xa e fa i maxandi be, e i xili matɔxɔ, e gbilen e xa yunubi fɔxɔ ra i e rayaagixi naxan ma, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma, i xa i xa konyie, i xa ɲama Isirayila xa yunubie xafari, i xa i xa sɛriyɛ fanyi masen e bɛ alako e xa na ɲɛrɛ ki kolon, i fa tunɛ ragoro i xa bɔxi ma, i naxan findi e gbe ra.»<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />«Xa kaamɛ sa sin yi bɔxi ma, xa na mu fure, xa na mu baloe kanɛ, xa na mu gere, xa na mu gbaloe gbɛtɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />xa mixi nde sa i maxandi, xa i xa ɲama Isirayila a mawa i xɔn, barima e bara a kolon e xa tɔɔrɛ kelixi fe naxan ma, e fa e bɛlɛxɛ itala yi banxi mabiri, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma i magoroxi dɛnnaxɛ, i xa diɲɛ, i xa mixi birin sare fi a xa wali ra, i tan naxan adama birin bɔɲɛ ma fe kolon. I keren peti nan ibunadama birin sondon ma fe kolon. <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />Na kui e fama gaaxude i ya ra, e ɲɛrɛ i xa kira xɔn e xa simaya birin kui yi bɔxi ma, i naxan fixi muxu babae ma.»<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />«Xa xɔɲɛ nde sa fa kelife ɲamanɛ ma, naxan mu findi i xa ɲama Isirayila mixi nde ra, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />a fa i xili xungbe nun i sɛnbɛ xa fe ra, a i maxandi yi banxi kui, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma i i magoroxi dɛnnaxɛ, i xa a xa maxandi suxu alako si birin xa gaaxu i xili ya ra duniɲa, alɔ i xa ɲama Isirayila. E xa a kolon i tan nan xili maxandima yi banxi kui n naxan tixi.»<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />«Xa i xa ɲama sa mini a yaxuie gerede alɔ i a masen e bɛ ki naxɛ, xa e i maxandi yi taa mabiri ra i dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi, xa e i maxandi yi banxi mabiri ra n naxan tixi i xili ra, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />i xa na fe mato, i xa e xa dubɛ suxu, i xa kiiti tinxinxi sa e bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />«Xa e sa yunubi raba i ra, alɔ adamadi birin darixi naxan na, xa i bɔɲɛ te e xili ma, i fa e sa e yaxuie sagoe, e findi geelimanie ra yire makuye, xa na mu a ra yire makɔrɛxi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />xa e bara xaxili sɔtɔ na konyiya kui, e fa i maxandi e xa geeli kui, ‹Muxu bara yunubi raba, muxu bara fe ɲaaxi raba, muxu bara kobi,› <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />xa e man e yɛtɛ ragbilen i ma e bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra, e nii birin na, e fa i maxandi ɲamanɛ ma konyiya kui yi bɔxi mabiri, i naxan fixi e babae ma, a nun yi taa mabiri, i naxan sugandixi, a nun yi banxi mabiri, n naxan tixi i bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />i xa na fe mato kelife koore ma i magoroxi dɛnnaxɛ, i xa i tuli mati e xa maxandi nun e wa xui ra, i xa kiiti tinxinxi sa e bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />i xa diɲɛ i xa ɲama ma naxan yunubi rabaxi i ra. I xa e xa yunubie xafari e naxan nabaxi i ra. I xa hinnɛ e ra e yaxuie ya xɔri, alako e yaxuie fan xa hinnɛ e ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />E findixi i xa ɲama nan na, i kɛ tongoe, i naxee ramini Misira bɔxi ra konyiya kui.»<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />«Yakɔsi, n Marigi Ala, i xa muxu xa maxandi mato, i xa a ramɛ, muxu naxan nabaxi yi banxi kui, <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />barima i tan nan muxu ba duniɲa bɔnsɔɛ tagi muxu xa findi i kɛ tongoe ra, alɔ i a masen Isirayila bɛ ki naxɛ i xa konyi Munsa saabui ra, a to muxu benbae ramini Misira bɔxi ra.»<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Mangɛ Sulemani to gɛ na maxandi tide Alatala bɛ, a naxa keli Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade yire, a xinbi nu sinxi dɛnnaxɛ a bɛlɛxɛe itexi koore ma. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Na tɛmui a naxa ti Isirayila ɲama ya xɔri, a duba e bɛ a xui itexi ra. A naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />«Tantui na Alatala bɛ, naxan bara malabui fi a xa ɲama Isirayila ma, alɔ a a masen ki naxɛ. A masenyi naxee ti a xa konyi Annabi Munsa saabui ra, keren mu na a mu naxan nakamali. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Won Marigi Alatala xa lu won sɛɛti ma alɔ a raba won benbae bɛ ki naxɛ. Ala naxa won nabolo, a naxa won nabɛɲin. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Ala xa won bɔɲɛ ya mafindi a ma, alako won xa won ɲɛrɛ a xa kira xɔn ma, won xa a xa yaamari birin nabatu, won xa gbilen fee fɔxɔ ra a tɔnyi dɔxɔxi naxee ra, won xa bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra a naxan so won benbae yi ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Ala xa ratu n ma maxandi ma kɔɛ nun yanyi. Won Marigi Alatala xa n tan a xa konyi nun a xa ɲama Isirayila makanta fe ɲaaxi ma lɔxɔɛ birin, <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />alako duniɲa birin xa a kolon a Alatala nan na Ala ra. Ala gbɛtɛ mu na. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Wo bɔɲɛ birin xa lu won Marigi Alatala nan bɛ, alako won xa a xa yaamarie ratinmɛ, won xa won ɲɛrɛ a xa sɛriyɛ ma alɔ wo darixi a ra ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Mangɛ nun Isirayila ɲama birin naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba Alatala bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa ninge wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin ba xanunteya sɛrɛxɛ ra, a nun yɛxɛɛ wulu kɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn. Na dangi xanbi, Mangɛ nun ɲama naxa Ala xa banxi rabi. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Sulemani naxa tɛtɛ yire rasɛniyɛn sɛrɛxɛ ra Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi ya ra. A naxa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie ba naa, a nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe ture nun sansi xɔri ra, barima sɛrɛxɛbade yɔxui daaxi, Sulemani naxan yailan, na nu xurun na sɛrɛxɛ birin bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Sulemani nun Isirayilakae birin sali raba nɛ won Marigi Alatala ya xɔri xi solofere bun ma. Ɲama gbegbe fa nɛ kelife Xamata han Misira xure. E to gɛ na sali ra, e man naxa sali xi solofere gbɛtɛ bun ma, a findi xi fu nun naani ra. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />A xi fu nun suuli nde, mangɛ naxa ɲama bɛɲin e xa gbilen e xɔnyi. E naxa duba mangɛ bɛ, e fa gbilen e xɔnyi sɛɛwɛ kui, Alatala xa hinnɛ xa fe ra a xa konyi Dawuda nun a xa ɲama Isirayila mabiri.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa masenyi Sulemani bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">Yudaya Mangɛe II 7:11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Mangɛ Sulemani to gɛ Alatala xa banxi nun a yɛtɛ xa banxi tide, a a waxɔnfe birin naba na xa fe ra, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Alatala man naxa mini a ma alɔ a raba Gabayon ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Alatala naxa a fala a bɛ, «N bara i xui mɛ, n bara i xa maxandi suxu. N bara tin yi banxi xa findi n gbe ra, i naxan tixi. N xili xa lu a ma abadan, n nan n ɲɛngi sama nɛ a xɔn ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Xa i sa i ɲɛrɛ n ma kira xɔn ma bɔɲɛ tinxinxi ra, alɔ i baba Dawuda, i fa n ma yaamarie, n ma sɛriyɛ, nun n ma xaranyi suxu a fanyi ra, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />n i xa mangɛ kibanyi mabanbanma nɛ, alɔ n a saataxi i baba Dawuda bɛ ki naxɛ. N a masen nɛ a bɛ, ‹Isirayila mangɛya mu bama i bɔnsɔɛ yi ra.› <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Kɔnɔ xa wo wo kobe ratoma, wo fa gbilen n ma sɛriyɛ nun n ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra, xa wo sa tuubi Ala gbɛtɛ bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />n wo talama nɛ n ma bɔxi ma, n naxan fixi wo ma, n yi banxi rakasanɲɛ, n naxan findixi n xili falade ra. Na tɛmui si birin fama nɛ yelede Isirayila xa fe ma, e yo wo ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Na tɛmui mixi nɛ dangima yi banxi ra, naxan bara xili fanyi sɔtɔ, e dɛ ixarama nɛ, e a fala, ‹Munfe ra Alatala yi bɔxi nun yi banxi xa fe xun nakanaxi yi ki?› <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />E a yaabima nɛ, ‹Ala yi birin niyaxi e ra nɛ barima e bara gbilen e babae Marigi Alatala fɔxɔ ra, naxan e ramini Misira bɔxi ra. E bara e tagi ixiri ala gbɛtɛe ra, e e batu, e tuubi e bɛ. E yi tɔɔrɛ sɔtɔxi na nan ma.›»<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Sulemani xa wali ndee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:1-18">Yudaya Mangɛe II 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu bara Alatala xa banxi nun a yɛtɛ xa banxi ti ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Tire mangɛ Xirami to bara nu sɛdiri nun sipirɛ wurie, nun xɛɛma so Sulemani yi ra, a nu wama naxan xasabi xɔn, a naxa taa mɔxɔɲɛn fi Xirami ma Galile bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Xirami to mini na taae matode, nee mu rafan a ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />A naxa a fala Sulemani bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyi, i taa mɔɔli mundun fixi n ma yi ki?» Xirami naxa na taae xili sa «Taa fufafu.» Na xili nan na e xun ma han to. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Kɔnɔ Xirami naxa xɛɛma kilo wulu naani rasanba mangɛ Sulemani ma.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu bara teku wali rakeli banxie nun taae tife ra, alɔ Alatala xa banxi, mangɛ Sulemani xa banxi, Milo taa, Darisalamu tɛtɛ, Xasori taa, Megido taa, nun Geseri taa. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Firawuna, Misira mangɛ, dusu nɛ Geseri taa xun na, a tɛ so na ra, na Kanaankae birin faxa. Na dangi xanbi a na fi a xa di ginɛ ma, naxan dɔxɔ mangɛ Sulemani xɔn ma.<verse eid="1KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Mangɛ Sulemani yi taa birin ti nɛ: Geseri taa, Beti Xoron Labe, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Baalati nun Tamari naxee nu na gbengberenyi ma, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />nun taa gbɛtɛ sɔɔri ragisee nun soee nu ragatama dɛnnaxɛ. Sulemani nu bara banxi nun taa gbegbe ti Darisalamu, Liban bɔxi, nun a xa bɔxi birin ma, alɔ a nu wama a xɔn ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Xitikae, Amorikae, Peresikae, Hiwikae, nun Yebusukae naxee lu Isirayila bɔxi ma, kɔnɔ e mu findi Isirayilakae ra. <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />E babae mu faxa Isirayila xa santidɛgɛma saabui ra Isirayilakae so tɛmui. Na kui Sulemani na mixie findi nɛ konyie ra. Han to e na konyiya kui. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Kɔnɔ Sulemani mu tin Isirayila di yo xa findi konyi ra. Isirayilakae nu findixi a xa sɔɔrie, sɛbɛlitie, sɔɔri xunyie, nun soe ragi xunyie nan na. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Mangɛ Sulemani mixi kɛmɛ suuli mixi tongo suuli nan ti xunyie ra konyie xun ma naxee nu a xa wali rabama.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Sulemani Firawuna xa di ginɛ tongo nɛ Dawuda xa taa kui, a a ratunu banxi gbɛtɛ kui, a naxan ti a bɛ. Na tɛmui fa a naxa Milo taa ti.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxie nun xanunteya sɛrɛxɛe bama sanya saxan ɲɛ yo ɲɛ sɛrɛxɛbade fari, a naxan yailan Alatala bɛ. A nu surayi bama sɛrɛxɛ ra sɛrɛxɛbade nde fari naxan nu na Alatala ya i. A Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi raɲɔn.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Mangɛ Sulemani kunkuie yailan nɛ Esiyon Geberi, Elata fɛ ma, baa dɛ ra naxan nu na Edon bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Mangɛ Xirami walikɛ ndee so nɛ Sulemani yi ra, naxee nu bakima na kunkuie kui Sulemani xa walikɛe sɛɛti ma. E nu kunkui wali kolon a fanyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Na kunkuie siga nɛ Ofiri bɔxi ma xɛɛma kilo wulu fu nun naani tongode mangɛ Sulemani bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Seeba Mangɛ Ginɛ fafe Mangɛ Sulemani xɛɛbude</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">Yudaya Mangɛe II 9:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Seeba mangɛ ginɛ to Sulemani xili gbe mɛ Alatala xili xa fe ra, a naxa siga maxɔrinyi xɔrɔxɔɛe tide a ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />A naxa siga Darisalamu, a sanbase gbegbe xanin a xun ma ɲɔxɔmɛe fari alɔ labundɛ, xɛɛma, nun gɛmɛ tofanyie. A naxa a xa maxɔrinyi birin ti Sulemani ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa a xa maxɔrinyie birin yaabi, na birin naxa sɔɔnɛya a bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Seeba mangɛ ginɛ to gɛ Sulemani xa lɔnni tode, a nun a xa banxie a naxee ti, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />a xa donsee, a xa walikɛe nun e wali ki, e xa dugie, e ludee, na fe birin naxa a dɛ ixara. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />A naxa a fala mangɛ bɛ, «N fe naxee birin mɛxi n ma bɔxi ma i xa masenyie nun i xa lɔnni xa fe ra, na birin findixi nɔndi nan na. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Beenun n xa be to n yɛtɛ ra, n mu la e xa masenyi ra. Kɔnɔ yakɔsi n bara a kolon i xa lɔnni gbo dangife e naxan masenxi n bɛ. I fe naxan birin tagi rabaxi n bɛ nun i xa naafuli, na dangi i xili ra. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi na i xa mixie bɛ, ɲɛlɛxinyi na i xa konyie bɛ, barima e na i sɛɛti ma tɛmui birin i xa lɔnni ramɛfe ra. <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Tantui na i Marigi Alatala bɛ, naxan hinnɛxi i ra, a fa i dɔxɔ Isirayila mangɛ kibanyi kui. I Marigi Ala na raba nɛ barima Isirayila rafan a ma abadan. A i findixi nɛ e xa mangɛ ra alako i xa e yamari tinxinyi nun nɔndi ra.» <verse eid="1KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />A naxa xɛɛma kilo wulu naani fi mangɛ ma, a nun labundɛ gbegbe, nun gɛmɛ tofanyie. Kabi na tɛmui, Seeba mangɛ ginɛ labundɛ xasabi naxan fi mangɛ Sulemani ma na ɲɔndɔn mu to Isirayila bɔxi ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Xirami nun Sulemani xa walikɛe naxee fa xɛɛma ra kelife Ofiri bɔxi ma, nee man naxa fa wuri nun gɛmɛ tofanyie ra. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Mangɛ naxa na wuri rawali Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi sode dɛ ra, a nun mangɛ xa banxi sode dɛ ra. A man naxa na wuri rawali kɔrae yailanfe ra bɛɛtibae bɛ. Na wuri mɔɔli mu nu toxi Yudaya sinden.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa Seeba mangɛ ginɛ waxɔnse birin so a yi ra dangife a naxan nasanbaxi a ma. Na xanbi, a naxa gbilen a xa bɔxi ma, a tan nun a xa mixie.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Sulemani xa naafuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:14-17">Yudaya Mangɛe II 1:14-17</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">9:13-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Ɲɛ yo ɲɛ Sulemani nu xɛɛma kilo wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin, kilo kɛmɛ senni tongo naani nun naani sɔtɔma, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />bafe a naxan sɔtɔ yulɛya duuti ra. A man nu xɛɛma nun gbeti sɔtɔma mangɛe nun gominae ra Arabu bɔxi ma.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa sɔɔri makantase kɛmɛ firin yailan xɛɛma ra, kankan yailanxi xɛɛma kilo solofere nan na. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />A man naxa sɔɔri makantase xunxuri kɛmɛ saxan yailan xɛɛma ra, kankan yailanxi xɛɛma kilo saxan nan na. A naxa e gbaku banxi kui naxan xili falama Liban Fɔtɔn Banxi. <verse eid="1KI 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Mangɛ naxa kibanyi xungbe yailan sili ɲinyi ra, a fa xɛɛma fanyi maso a ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Santide senni nu na na kibanyi ma. A xanbi radigilinxi, bɛlɛxɛ sade firin nu na a sɛɛtie ma, yɛtɛ masolixi firin fan nu na a sɛɛtie ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Yɛtɛ fu nun firin fan masolixi nu na santidee sɛɛtie ma, senni nu na yirefanyi ma, sennie nu na kɔɔla ma. Na kibanyi maniyɛ mu nu na mangataa yo kui sinden. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Mangɛ Sulemani xa pɔɔti birin nun Liban Fɔtɔn Banxi xa pileti birin nu yailanxi xɛɛma nan na. A mu nu gbeti rawalima fefe ma, a tide mu gbo a bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Kunkuie nu na mangɛ yi ra naxee nu sigama Tarasisi ɲɛ saxan yo ɲɛ saxan xɛɛma, gbeti, sili ɲinyi, kule, nun xɔni tofanyie tongode. Xirami xa walikɛe nu a malima na wali kui.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Mangɛ Sulemani xa bannaya nun a xa lɔnni naxa gbo yɛ dangi bɔxi mangɛ birin na. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Bɔxi mangɛ birin nu wama Sulemani xa lɔnni ramɛfe Ala naxan saxi a xaxili ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Nee birin nu mangɛ sanbama gbeti, xɛɛma, dugie, geresosee, labundɛe, soe, nun sofalee ra ɲɛ yo ɲɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Sulemani naxa sɔɔri ragisee nun soe ragie malan. Sɔɔri ragise wulu keren kɛmɛ naani, nun soe ragie wulu fu nun firin nan nu na mangataa Darisalamu nun taa makantaxi gbɛtɛe. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Mangɛ naxa a niya gbeti xa wuya Darisalamu dangife gɛmɛ xɔri ra. Wuri fanyi fan naxan xili sɛdiri naxa wuya dangife sikomoro wuri ra naxee na Sefela bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Sulemani nu soe sarama Misira nun Kowa bɔxi nan ma. Mangɛ xa yulɛe nu sigama e tongode. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />E sɔɔri ragise sara gbeti kilo solofere ra, e soe sara gbeti kilo keren nun a tagi. E na mɔɔli sara Xiti nun Arami mangɛe fan bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Sulemani gbilenfe Alatala fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa ginɛ gbegbe dɔxɔ naxee mu findixi Isirayilakae ra, alɔ Firawuna xa di ginɛ, Mowaba ginɛe, Amoni ginɛe, Edon ginɛe, Sidɔn ginɛe, nun Xiti ginɛe. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Alatala nu bara a fala Isirayilakae bɛ na sie xa fe ra, «Wo naxa siga e xɔnyi, e fan naxa fa wo xɔnyi. Xa na mu, e wo bɔɲɛe ya rafindima nɛ e xa alae mabiri.» Kɔnɔ Sulemani tan bira na mixie nan fɔxɔ ra, ginɛe maxanufe ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />A mangɛ di ginɛ kɛmɛ solofere nan dɔxɔ, a konyi ginɛ kɛmɛ saxan fan tongo. Na ginɛe naxa a bɔɲɛ mafindi.<verse eid="1KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />A to fori, na ginɛe nu bara a bɔɲɛ birin mafindi ala gbɛtɛe ma, a mu bira a Marigi Alatala fɔxɔ ra alɔ a baba Dawuda. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Mangɛ Sulemani nu Sidɔnkae xa ala Asiteroti nun Amonikae xa ala Mɔlɔkɔ fan batuma. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa fe raba, naxan mu rafan Alatala ma, a mu a xui rakamali Alatala bɛ alɔ a baba Dawuda. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Na kui Sulemani naxa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan Mowaba xa ala Kemosi bɛ, a nun Amonikae xa ala Mɔlɔkɔ bɛ geya fari, naxan nu na Darisalamu ya ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />A nu na mɔɔli rabama a xa ginɛe birin bɛ, naxee nu fatanxi si gbɛtɛe ra, naxee nu surayi nun sɛrɛxɛe bama e xa alae bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Alatala naxa xɔnɔ mangɛ Sulemani ma, barima a nu bara a kobe so Isirayila Marigi Alatala ra, naxan mini a ma sanya firin. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Alatala nu bara tɔnyi dɔxɔ ala gbɛtɛ batufe ra, kɔnɔ Sulemani mu Alatala xa yaamari suxu. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Na kui Alatala naxa a fala Sulemani bɛ, «I to bara na mɔɔli raba, i mu bira n ma yaamarie fɔxɔ ra n naxee birin masen i bɛ, i n ma saatɛ kana, n i xa mangɛya bama nɛ i yi ra, n fa a so i xa konyi nde yi ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Kɔnɔ i baba Dawuda xa fe ra, n mu na rabama i xa simaya kui, n mangɛya bama nɛ i xa di xɛmɛ yi ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />N mu mangɛya birin bama a yi ra, n bɔnsɔɛ keren nan luma i xa di bɛ n ma konyi Dawuda xa fe ra, nun Darisalamu xa fe ra n naxan sugandixi.»<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Alatala naxa Sulemani gerefa nde ramini, naxan nu xili Hadada. Edon mangɛ xa di nan nu a ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Dawuda Edon bɔxi gere tɛmui naxɛ, a xa sɔɔri mangɛ Yowaba nu bara te naa Isirayila sɔɔrie furee ragatade. Na tɛmui a man naxa Edon xɛmɛ birin faxa. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yowaba nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa lu naa kike senni, han e gɛ xɛmɛ birin faxade <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Hadada nun a baba xa konyi Edonka ndee nu bara e gi, e siga Misira. Na raba Hadada dimɛdi tɛmui nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />E to keli Madiyan, e naxa siga Paran. E naxa mixie tongo mɛnni, e fa siga Misira Firawuna yire. Misira mangɛ naxa banxi so a yi ra, a a ɲɔxɔ sa a xa donse fe xɔn ma, a bɔxi fan fi a ma.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Hadada naxa rafan Firawuna ma, han a a xa mangɛ ginɛ xunya fi a ma ginɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Mangɛ ginɛ Tapenesi xunya naxa di xɛmɛ bari a bɛ, naxan nu xili Genubati. Tapenesi na dɛ ba Firawuna xɔnyi nɛ, a fa lu mɛnni Firawuna xa die ya ma.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Hadada to a mɛ a Dawuda nun a xa sɔɔri mangɛ Yowaba bara faxa, a naxa a fala Firawuna bɛ, a xa diɲɛ a ma a xa gbilen a xɔnyi. <verse eid="1KI 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Firawuna naxa a yaabi, «Munfe ra i wama gbilenfe i xɔnyi? I waxɔnfe birin na be.» A naxa a yaabi, «I nɔndi, kɔnɔ diɲɛ n xa gbilen.»<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Ala naxa gerefa gbɛtɛ ramini mangɛ Sulemani bɛ, naxan findixi Eliyada xa di Reson na, naxan nu bara a gi kelife Soba mangɛ Hadadeseri xɔnyi, <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Dawuda nu na e gerefe tɛmui naxɛ. Reson xa sɔɔrie nan malan a fɛ ma, e fa lu Damasi, e mangɛya sɔtɔ mɛnni. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Reson nun Hadada findi Sulemani yaxuie nan na a xa simaya birin kui. Arami mangɛ Reson nu Isirayila ɲama xɔnxi.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Nebati xa di Yerobowami nu kelixi Sereda nɛ Efirami bɔxi ma. A nga naxa findi kaaɲɛ ginɛ nde ra, naxan xili Seruya. A nu walima mangɛ Sulemani xa mixie ya ma, kɔnɔ mangɛ xa fe mu nu rafan a ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Na rakeli yi fe nan ma: Mangɛ Sulemani nu na Milo tife, a nun a baba xa taa tɛtɛ yire nde. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yerobowami to findi gbangbalanyi fanyi nan na, Sulemani naxa a findi teku wali xunyi ra Yusufu bɔnsɔɛ xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Lɔxɔɛ nde Yerobowami naxa mini Darisalamu, a Annabi Ahiya Siloka li kira xɔn ma e doro. Donma xungbe nɛɛnɛ nu ragoroxi namiɲɔnmɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Annabi Ahiya naxa a xa donma nɛɛnɛ ibɔɔ xuntun fu nun firin na, <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />a fa a fala Yerobowami bɛ, «Xuntun fu tongo, barima Isirayila Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi n bɛ, ‹N fama nɛ mangɛya bade Sulemani yi ra, n fa bɔnsɔɛ fu sa i tan xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />N bɔnsɔɛ keren luma nɛ Sulemani bun ma n ma konyi Dawuda xa fe ra nun Darisalamu xa fe ra, n taa naxan sugandixi Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />N na rabama nɛ barima e bara e kobe so n na, e Sidɔn xa ala Asiteroti, nun Mowaba xa ala Kemosi, nun Amoni xa ala Mɔlɔkɔ batu. E mu e ɲɛrɛma n ma kira xɔn ma, e mu n ma yaamarie ratinmɛma alɔ Sulemani baba Dawuda a raba nɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />N mu mangɛya birin bama Sulemani yi ra, a xa lu mangɛya kui a xa simaya birin na n ma konyi sugandixi Dawuda xa fe ra, naxan bara n ma yaamarie nun n waxɔnfe rabatu. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Kɔnɔ n mangɛya bama nɛ Dawuda xa di Sulemani yi ra, n bɔnsɔɛ fu fi i ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />N bɔnsɔɛ keren nan luma a xa di yi ra, alako n ma konyi Dawuda fɔxi xa lu Darisalamu abadan, n dɛnnaxɛ sugandixi n xili xa fe ra. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />N i tongoma nɛ, n i findi mangɛ ra Isirayila xun na. I luma i waxɔnde nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Xa i sa i tuli mati n na, xa i sa i ɲɛrɛ n ma kira xɔn, xa i sa wali n bɛ, i n ma yaamarie ratinmɛ, i n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu, alɔ n ma konyi Dawuda a raba ki naxɛ, n luma nɛ i sɛɛti ma tɛmui birin, n i bɔnsɔɛ rasabatima nɛ, alɔ n naxan nabaxi n ma konyi mangɛ Dawuda bɛ, n Isirayila fima nɛ i ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />N mangɛ Dawuda bɔnsɔɛe rayaagima nɛ, kɔnɔ kudɛ xa mu a ra.›» <verse eid="1KI 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Mangɛ Sulemani naxa wa Yerobowami faxafe. Na nan a niya, Yerobowami naxa a gi, a sa a xunyi taxu Sisaki ra Misira mangɛ. A naxa lu mɛnni han mangɛ Sulemani naxa faxa.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Sulemani xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ, a fɔlɛ nun a raɲɔnyi, a sɛbɛxi Sulemani xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Sulemani xa mangɛya naxa bu ɲɛ tongo naani Darisalamu nun Isirayila xun ma. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Na xanbi, Sulemani naxa laaxira. E naxa a ragata a babae sɛɛti ma a baba Dawuda xa taa kui. A xa di Robowami naxa lu a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Robowami nun Yerobowami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-15">Yudaya Mangɛe II 10:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Robowami naxa siga Sikemi, barima Isirayilakae birin nu malanxi naa, e xa a ti mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Nebati xa di Yerobowami naxa na fe mɛ Misira, a to a gi Sulemani ma a siga dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Mixi ndee naxa a xili a xa fa Isirayila bɔxi ma. Yerobowami nun Isirayilakae birin naxa siga Robowami yire, e a fala a bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />«I baba muxu suxu nɛ alɔ konyie. Yakɔsi tan, i xa nde ba muxu xa kote ra i baba naxan saxi muxu fari. Na kui muxu fama i xa yaamari rabatude.» <verse eid="1KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />A naxa e yaabi, «Xi saxan na dangi, wo xa fa.» Ɲama naxa siga.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Mangɛ Robowami naxa marasi fen forie ra, naxee nu na a baba Sulemani fɛ ma a xa simaya kui, a fa e maxɔrin, «Wo marasi mundun fima n ma n nan n ma ɲama yaabima naxan na?» <verse eid="1KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />E naxa a yaabi, «Xa i fe fanyi rabama ɲama bɛ, xa i tin e waxɔnfe ra, xa i wɔyɛn fanyi fala e bɛ, e luma nɛ i xa yaamari bun ma tɛmui birin.»<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Kɔnɔ Robowami mu tin forie xa marasi ra. A naxa a lanfanma booree maxɔrin a lanma a xa naxan naba. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />A naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo marasi mundun fima n ma n na n ma ɲama yaabima naxan na, ɲama naxan n mayandima n xa nde ba e xa kote ra n baba naxan saxi e fari.» <verse eid="1KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />A lanfanmae naxa a yaabi, «I xa yi ɲama yaabi yi ki, naxee i mayandixi i xa nde ba e xa kote ra i baba naxan saxi e fari. I xa a fala e bɛ, ‹N bɛlɛxɛ sole lanmadi xungbo n baba tagi bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Yakɔsi, n baba xa kote xɔrɔxɔ a naxan dɔxɔ wo ma, n tan na xun masama nɛ. N baba wo bɔnbɔ luxusinyie nan na, kɔnɔ n tan fama wo bɔnbɔde talie nan na.›»<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Xi saxan to dangi, Yerobowami nun ɲama naxa siga Robowami yire, naxan nu bara a fala, «Xi saxan na dangi, wo xa fa.» <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Mangɛ Robowami naxa e yaabi a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, a mu forie xa marasi tongo. <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />A naxa e yaabi a lanfanmae xa marasi ra, «N na n baba xa kote xɔrɔxɔɛ xun ma sama nɛ a naxan dɔxɔ wo ma. N baba wo bɔnbɔ luxusinyie nan na, kɔnɔ n tan fama wo bɔnbɔde talie nan na.» <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Na kui, mangɛ mu tin a tuli matide ɲama ra. Marigi Alatala nu bara na ragiri alako a xa a xa masenyi rakamali a naxan fala Nebati xa di Yerobowami bɛ Annabi Ahiya Siloka saabui ra.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Isirayilakae to a kolon mangɛ mu tin a tuli matide e ra, e naxa a yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 12:16">«Munse na won nun Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ tagi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 12:16">Kɛ mu na muxu bɛ Yisayi xa die tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 12:16">Isirayila xa gbilen e xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 12:16">Yakɔsi Dawuda, i xa mɛɛni i xa banxi ma i yɛtɛ ra.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Na kui, Isirayila birin naxa gbilen e xɔnyi.<verse eid="1KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Isirayilaka naxee nu sabatixi Yudaya taae kui, nee naxa lu Robowami xa yaamari bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Na dangi xanbi, mangɛ Robowami naxa Adorami xɛɛ, naxan ɲɛngi nu saxi teku wali xɔn ma, kɔnɔ Isirayilakae naxa a magɔnɔ han a faxa. Mangɛ Robowami naxa a gi keren na sigafe ra Darisalamu a xa sɔɔri ragise kui. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Isirayila Dawuda xabilɛ matandi na ki nɛ. Han to e mu lanxi.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Isirayilaka birin to a mɛ a Yerobowami bara fa, e naxa e malan, e a xili, e a findi mangɛ ra Isirayila birin xun ma. Yudaya nan keren sa Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ dɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Robowami to so Darisalamu, a naxa Yuda nun Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ sɔɔrie malan, geresoe fanyi wulu kɛmɛ tongo solomasaxan, alako e xa Isirayila gere, Isirayila xa gbilen Robowami xa mangɛya bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Kɔnɔ Alatala naxa a masen a xa mixi Semaya bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />«A fala Sulemani xa di Robowami bɛ, Yudaya mangɛ, a nun Isirayilakae birin naxee na Yudaya nun Bunyamin bɔxi ma, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />Alatala xa masenyi nan yi ki: ‹Wo naxa te de sigafe ra won ngaxakerenyie gerede. Wo birin xa gbilen wo xɔnyi, barima n tan nan yi fe ragirixi.›» E naxa Alatala xa masenyi rabatu, e naxa gbilen, e mu siga Yerobowami gerede sɔnɔn.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Yerobowami naxa Sikemi taa ti Efirami geyae yire, a sabati naa. Na dangi xanbi, a man naxa siga, a Peniyeli ti. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yerobowami naxa a fala a bɔɲɛ ma, «Tɛmunde yi ɲama fama gbilende, e lu Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ xa yaamari bun ma, <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />xa e luma te ra sɛrɛxɛe bade Alatala xa banxi kui Darisalamu. Yi ɲama bɔɲɛ ya fama nɛ rafindide e marigi Robowami Yudaya mangɛ ma, e n tan faxa, e fa gbilen Yudaya mangɛ Robowami ma.»<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />A to gɛ marasi fende, mangɛ naxa ninge misaali firin yailan xɛɛma ra, a fa a fala ɲama bɛ, «Wo xa sigɛ Darisalamu mu lanma sɔnɔn. Isirayila, wo xa alae nan yi ki naxee wo ramini Misira bɔxi ma.» <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />A naxa keren ti Beteli, a keren ti Dana. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Na nan findixi yunubi ra e bɛ. Ɲama nu luma siga ra na kuyee batude Beteli, xa na mu a ra Dana. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Yerobowami naxa salidee ti yire itexi, a fa mixie ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra naxee mu findi Lewi die ra.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yerobowami naxa sali nde raba kike solomasaxan nde xi fu nun suuli nde ra, alɔ sali naxan mɔɔli nu rabama Yudaya. A yɛtɛ yati naxa sɛrɛxɛe ba na kuye ninge daaxie bɛ, a naxee yailan Beteli. A naxa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe dɔxɔ Beteli na salide yiree, a naxee ti geyae kɔn. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />A naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba na salide kui, a naxan yailan Beteli. A na raba kike solomasaxan nde xi fu nun suuli nde nɛ. A nu bara na kike sugandi a yɛtɛ kan waxɔnki ra. A naxa sali xungbe raba Isirayilakae bɛ, a surayi gan sɛrɛxɛ ra Beteli sɛrɛxɛbade fari.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Namiɲɔnmɛ xa masenyi Yerobowami bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Alatala xa xɛɛra nde naxa fa Beteli kelife Yudaya bɔxi ma. Yerobowami nu tixi sɛrɛxɛbade fari, a na surayi ganfe sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Alatala xa xɛɛra naxa a xui ite sɛrɛxɛbade a xɔrɔxɔ ra a Alatala xa masenyi fala a xui itexi ra. A naxɛ, «Sɛrɛxɛbade, sɛrɛxɛbade! Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: ‹Di xɛmɛ nde barima nɛ mangɛ Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ ya ma, a xili Yosiya. A i xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe findi sɛrɛxɛ ra i fari, naxee surayi bama sɛrɛxɛ ra salide geyae fari. Mixi xɔrie nan yati ganma i fari!›» <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Na lɔxɔɛ a naxa tɔnxuma fi e ma, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Tɔnxuma nan ya alako wo xa a kolon a n tan Alatala xui yati nan falaxi wo bɛ. Yi sɛrɛxɛbade fama nɛ ibɔɔde, a xube ibɔgonma bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Mangɛ Yerobowami to Ala xa xɛɛra xa masenyi mɛ, a naxan fala a xui itexi ra Beteli sɛrɛxɛbade xa fe ra, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ itala na sɛrɛxɛbade fari, a fa a fala, «Na xɛmɛ suxu.» A to na raba, a bɛlɛxɛ naxa xɔrɔxɔ a ra, a mu nɔ a ramaxade sɔnɔn. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Na sɛrɛxɛbade naxa ibɔɔ keren na, a xube naxa ibɔgon bɔxi ma, alɔ Alatala xa xɛɛra a fala ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Na kui mangɛ naxa a fala Ala xa xɛɛra bɛ, «I Marigi Alatala maxandi n bɛ, alako n bɛlɛxɛ xa yalan.» Ala xa xɛɛra naxa Ala maxandi a bɛ, Yerobowami bɛlɛxɛ naxa yalan alɔ a singe. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Mangɛ naxa a fala Ala xa xɛɛra bɛ, «Fa n xɔnyi i xa i malabu, n buɲa nde fima i ma.» <verse eid="1KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Ala xa xɛɛra naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Hali i naafuli gbegbe fima n ma, n mu soma i xɔnyi. N mu sese donma, n mu sese minma be, <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />barima Alatala n yamarixi yi nan na, ‹I naxa sese don, i naxa sese min na yire. I xa gbilen i xɔnyi kira gbɛtɛ ra.›» <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />A naxa gbilen kira gbɛtɛ ra, a mu gbilen kira ra a fa naxan xɔn ma a singe.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi nde nu na Beteli taa kui. A xa di nde naxa na fe ya maxaran a bɛ, Ala xa xɛɛra naxan birin naba Beteli na lɔxɔɛ, nun a wɔyɛnyi naxee fala mangɛ bɛ. A xa di to gɛ na fe birin masende a bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />a naxa a tan nun a xunyae maxɔrin, «A gbilen kira mundun na?» A xa die nu bara a kolon na xɛɛra gbilen kira naxan na. E to na fala e baba bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo fa n ma sofale ra.» E to a yailan, a naxa te a fari, <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />a bira Ala xa xɛɛra fɔxɔ ra, han a sa a li wuri nde bun ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">A naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ala xa xɛɛra na i tan nan na naxan keli Yudaya?» A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, n tan nan a ra.» <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi naxa a fala a bɛ, «Won xa gbilen n xɔnyi, won xa won dɛge.» <verse eid="1KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Ala xa xɛɛra naxa a yaabi, «N mu nɔma gbilende, n mu nɔma sode i xɔnyi. N mu sese donma, n mu sese minma yi yire, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />barima Alatala a masenxi nɛ n bɛ, ‹I naxa sese don, i naxa sese min, i naxa gbilen kira ra i fa fama faxi naxan xɔn ma.›»<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Xɛmɔxi naxa a fala a bɛ, «N tan fan findixi namiɲɔnmɛ nan na alɔ i tan. Malekɛ nde nan goroxi n ma, a Ala xa masenyi ti n bɛ, a falafe ra, ‹Na mixi ragbilen i xɔnyi, a xa a dɛge, a xa a min.›» A nu wule nan falafe a bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Na kui Ala xa xɛɛra naxa gbilen, e naxa e dɛge, e naxa e min.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />E nu dɔxɔxi teebili ra tɛmui naxɛ, Ala xa masenyi naxa goro na namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi ma, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />a naxa a xui ite Ala xa xɛɛra bɛ naxan keli Yudaya bɔxi ma. A naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ala xa masenyi nan ya: ‹I to i Marigi Alatala xa yaamari matandi, i mu a xui suxu, <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />a falafe ra i naxa sese don, i naxa sese min be, i fure mu ragatama i benbae xa gaburi yire.›»<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛ to gɛ a dɛgede, na xɛmɔxi naxa fa a xa sofale ra alako boore xa siga. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />A to siga, a xa biyaasi kui yɛtɛ nde naxa dutun a ma kira xɔn ma, a a faxa. A fure naxa sa kira xɔn ma, a xa sofale nun na yɛtɛ naxa ti a fɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Dangi mixie naxa a fure to kira dɛ ra, yɛtɛ tixi a fɛ ma. E to Beteli li, namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi nu na dɛnnaxɛ, e naxa na fe fala mixie bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi naxan Ala xa xɛɛra ragbilen a xɔnyi a to na fe mɛ, a naxa a fala, «Na Ala xa xɛɛra nan a ra, naxan Alatala xa yaamari matandixi. Alatala bara a niya yɛtɛ xa a ibɔɔ, a xa a faxa, alɔ a masenxi a bɛ ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Na tɛmui a naxa a fala a xa die bɛ, «Wo fa n ma sofale ra.» E naxa na raba. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />A to siga, a naxa Ala xa xɛɛra fure to kira xɔn ma, yɛtɛ nun sofale tixi a fɛ ma. Yɛtɛ mu fure donxi, a mu sofale ibɔɔxi. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi naxa Ala xa xɛɛra fure tongo, a a sa a xa sofale fari, a gbilen a ra. Namiɲɔnmɛ xɛmɔxi naxa a raso taa kui, a a kasange, a a xa ɲɔn fe raba. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />A to a fure sa gaburi kui, a naxa a fala, «N ngaxakerenyi, i nu tɔɔrɔ.»<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Na to ba a ra, xɛmɔxi naxa a fala a xa die bɛ, «N na faxa, wo xa n sa yi gaburi kui Ala xa xɛɛra fure saxi dɛnnaxɛ. Wo xa n xɔrie sa a xɔrie fɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />A naxan fala Alatala xili ra Beteli nun yi sɛrɛxɛbade naxee na geyae ma Samari bɔxi ma, a fama nɛ kamalide.»<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Na fee to dangi, Yerobowami mu gbilen a xa fe ɲaaxie fɔxɔ ra. A mixi mɔɔli birin ti sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ra na salidee kui geyae fari, naxee na tin na ra. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Na nan findi Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ xa yunubi ra. Ala e sɔntɔ nɛ, a e fa e ralɔɛ duniɲa ma.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Yerobowami xa mangɛya raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Na tɛmui Yerobowami xa di Abiya naxa fura. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yerobowami naxa a fala a xa ginɛ bɛ, «I xa i maxiri kɛɲa nde ra, alako mixi naxa a kolon a Yerobowami xa ginɛ nan i ra. I siga Silo Annabi Abiya xɔn ma, naxan a fala n bɛ, a n findima nɛ yi bɔxi mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />I xa taami fu, se ɲɔxunmɛ ndee, nun kumi nde xanin a xɔn. A a falama nɛ i bɛ, fe naxan fama won ma di lide.»<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Yerobowami xa ginɛ naxa a raba na ki, a naxa siga Silo, a sa so Ahiya xɔnyi. Ahiya nu bara fori, a ya mu nu se igbɛma sɔnɔn. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Alatala nu bara a fala Ahiya bɛ, «Yerobowami xa ginɛ nan fafe yi ki, a faxi i maxɔrinde a xa di xa fe ma, barima na mu yalanxi. I xa n ma masenyi ti a bɛ. A fama gundo ki nan ma, alako mixi mu a kolonma ki naxɛ Yerobowami xa ginɛ na a ra.»<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Ahiya to a sanyi xui mɛ a bara makɔrɛ naadɛ ra, a naxa a fala a bɛ, «So, Yerobowami xa ginɛ. I faxi a gundo ki ma munfe ra? Masenyi xɔrɔxɔɛ nan yi ra i bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Siga, i sa a fala Yerobowami bɛ, Isirayila Marigi Alatala naxɛ, ‹N bara i xa fe ite ɲama tagi, n bara i ti mangɛ ra n ma ɲama Isirayila xun ma, <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />n bara mangɛya ba Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ yi ra, n a fi i tan ma. Kɔnɔ i mu luxi alɔ n ma konyi Dawuda, naxan n ma sɛriyɛ rabatu, a bira n fɔxɔ ra a bɔɲɛ birin na n waxɔnfe rabade. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />I wali ki ɲaaxu dangi mixi birin na. I bara n naxɔnɔ i xa kuyee batufe ra, naxee yailanxi wure raxunuxi ra. I bara i kobe raso n na. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Na nan a toxi, n gbaloe ragoroma i tan Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ, i xa konyie, nun i xa mixi xɔrɛyaxie ma. E birin sɔntɔma nɛ. N fe ɲaaxi bama nɛ wo tagi, alɔ ginɛ banxi makɔma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ naxan na faxa taa kui, baree nan na fure donma. Naxan na faxa wula i, xɔnie nan na donma.› Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ahiya man naxa a fala na ginɛ bɛ, «Yakɔsi i xa gbilen i xɔnyi. I nɛfɛ i sanyi ti taa kui, wo xa di faxama nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Isirayilakae birin a ɲɔn fe raba, e a ragata gaburi kui. A keren nan sama gaburi kui Yerobowami xa denbaya ya ma, barima a keren nan fe fanyi rabaxi Isirayila Marigi Alatala bɛ Yerobowami xa mixie tagi. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />A gbe mu luxi sɔnɔn Alatala xa fa mangɛ dɔxɔ Isirayila xun ma Yerobowami ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Alatala xa xɔnɛ sinma nɛ Isirayila ma, alɔ foye xungbe sinma kalee ma xure dɛ ra ki naxɛ. A Isirayila talama nɛ yi bɔxi fanyi ma, a naxan fi a benbae ma, a fa e rayensen yɛ xure kiri ma, barima e bara kuyee yailan. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />A Isirayila sama nɛ a yaxuie bɛlɛxɛ i yunubi xa fe ra, Isirayila naxan naba Yerobowami fɔxi ra.»<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Yerobowami xa ginɛ naxa siga. A to so Tirisa, a bara makɔrɛ naadɛ ra a xɔnyi, a xa di naxa faxa. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />E naxa a ragata, Isirayila birin fa a ɲɔn fe raba, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ a xa konyi Annabi Ahiya bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Yerobowami xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ na Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. A xa geree nun a xa mangɛya xa fe birin sɛbɛxi a kui. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yerobowami mangɛya raba nɛ ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin. Na tɛmui a naxa faxa, a xa di xɛmɛ Nadabo naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Sulemani xa di Robowami findi Yudaya mangɛ ra tɛmui naxɛ, a xa simaya nu na ɲɛ tongo naani nun keren. A ɲɛ fu nun solofere mangɛya nan naba Darisalamu, Alatala taa naxan sugandi a xili xa fe ra Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ birin tagi. A nga Amonika nu xili nɛ Naama.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Yudayakae fan naxa Alatala raxɔnɔ e xa yunubie ra, e benbae mu nu darixi naxee mɔɔli ra. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />E fan naxa sɛrɛxɛbadee yailan yire itexi birin fari wurie fɛ ma, e fa gɛmɛ masolixie nun Aseri wuri masolixie ti naa. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Langoee fan nu na naa. E nu fe ɲaaxie rabama na sali mɔɔli kui, alɔ sie, Ala naxee keri na bɔxi ma, nee nu a rabama ki naxɛ beenun Isirayilakae xa sabati naa.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Na bara a niya Robowami xa mangɛya ɲɛ suuli nde ra, Misira mangɛ Sisaki xa Darisalamu gere. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />A naxa naafuli birin tongo naxan nu na Alatala xa banxi nun mangɛ xa banxi kui. A naxa wure lefae fan tongo, Sulemani nu bara naxee maso xɛɛma ra. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Mangɛ Robowami naxa e ɲɔxɔɛ yailan yɔxui ra, a e taxu sɔɔri mangɛe ra naxee mangɛ xa banxi naadɛe makantama. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Mangɛ nu sigama Ala xa banxi kui tɛmui naxɛ, sɔɔrie nu na wure lefae rawalima. Mangɛ na gbilen, e man fa na wure lefae ragbilen sɔɔri banxi kui.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Robowami xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ sɛbɛxi Yudaya mangɛe xa taruxui nan kui. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Tɛmui birin, Robowami nun Yerobowami nu luma e boore gere ra. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Robowami to laaxira, e naxa a ragata a benbae sɛɛti ma Dawuda xa taa kui. A xa di Abiya naxa ti a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. A nga Amonika nu xili nɛ Naama.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Abiyami findife Yudaya mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-22">Yudaya Mangɛe II 13:1-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Yerobowami xa mangɛya ɲɛ fu nun solomasaxan nde ra, Nebati xa di Abiyami naxa ti mangɛ ra Yudaya. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />A xa mangɛya bu nɛ ɲɛ saxan Darisalamu. A nga nu xili nɛ Maaka, Abisaalon xa di. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />A fan naxa bira yunubi fee fɔxɔ ra, a baba nu naxee rabama. A bɔɲɛ birin mu nu na a Marigi Alatala bɛ, alɔ a benba Dawuda gbe nu na ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Kɔnɔ Alatala naxa a ti mangɛ ra Darisalamu a baba Dawuda xa fe ra, <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />barima Dawuda nu bara Alatala waxɔnfe raba, a bira a xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra a xa duniɲɛigiri birin kui, fo Uri Xitika xa fe. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Robowami nun Yerobowami nu e boore gerema e xa simaya birin kui.<verse eid="1KI 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Abiyami xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ sɛbɛxi Yudaya mangɛe xa taruxui kui. Abiyami nun Yerobowami nu e boore gerema tɛmui birin. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />A naxa laaxira, e a ragata a benbae sɛɛti ma Dawuda xa taa kui. A xa di Asa naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asa findife Yudaya mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 14:1-2">Yudaya Mangɛe II 14:1-2</ref>, 15:16-16:6,11-14)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Isirayila mangɛ Yerobowami xa mangɛya ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nde ra, Asa naxa ti mangɛ ra Yudaya. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />A ɲɛ tongo naani nun keren nan naba mangɛya kui Darisalamu. A nga nu xili nɛ Maaka, Abisaalon xa di. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa naxa Ala waxɔnfe raba alɔ a benba Dawuda a raba ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />A naxa kuye fe kana, a babae naxee fɔlɔ, a langoee keri na sɛrɛxɛbadee xun ma.<verse eid="1KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />A naxa mangɛ ginɛ binyɛ ba a nga Maaka ma, barima a nu Asera kuye batuma. A naxa na kuye rabira, a a gan, a a xube woli Sediron xure kui. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Hali Asa bɔɲɛ birin to nu na Alatala nan bɛ a xa simaya birin kui, a mu gɛ kuye sɛrɛxɛbadee birin kanade yire itexie Yudaya bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Asa naxa xɛɛma, gbeti, nun se fanyie raso Alatala xa banxi kui, a tan nun a baba naxee ba Alatala bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Asa nun Isirayila mangɛ Baasa nu e boore gerema e xa simaya birin kui. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Isirayila mangɛ Baasa naxa te Yudaya gere xili ma. A naxa Rama taa ti, alako a xa kira ibolon Yudaya mangɛ Asa ya ra. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Asa naxa gbeti nun xɛɛma tongo Alatala xa banxi nun mangɛ xa banxi kui, a a so xɛɛrae yi ra, a e xɛɛ Damasi taa, Arami mangɛ Ben Hadada yire yi masenyi ra: <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />«Won xa saatɛ xiri won tagi alɔ n baba nun i baba a raba ki naxɛ. Sanbase nan ya, xɛɛma nun gbeti. Saatɛ kana naxan na i nun Isirayila mangɛ Baasa tagi, alako a xa makuya n na.»<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ben Hadada naxa tin mangɛ Asa xa masenyi ra. A naxa a xa sɔɔri xunyie xɛɛ Isirayila taae suxude. E naxa Iyono, Dana, Abeli Beti Maaka, Kinereti, nun Nafatali bɔxi suxu. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Baasa to na fe mɛ, a naxa Rama tife wali rati, a lu Tirisa taa kui. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Na wali to ti, mangɛ Asa naxa Yudayakae birin xili, e xa fa teku gɛmɛe nun wurie tongode Baasa nu naxee rawalima Rama. E naxa na birin xanin, e a rawali Geba nun Misipa tife ra.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Asa xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ, a xa geree xa fe, a xa taa tife xa fe, nun a xa fe birin sɛbɛxi Yudaya nun Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. Asa to fori, fure nde naxa a sanyie suxu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Asa naxa laaxira. E naxa a ragata gaburi kui a benba Dawuda xa taa a benbae fɛ ma. A xa di Yehosafati naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadabo findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Yerobowami xa di Nadabo naxa ti Isirayila mangɛ ra Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ firin nde ra. Nadabo naxa mangɛya xanin ɲɛ firin Isirayila bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />A naxa fe raba naxan mu rafan Alatala ma, a a ɲɛrɛ a baba xa kira xɔn ma, naxan a niya Isirayila xa yunubi raba. <verse eid="1KI 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Ahiya xa di Baasa, fatanfe Isakari bɔnsɔɛ ra, naxa yanfanteya maxiri a xun ma. Baasa naxa a faxa Gibɛtɔn, a tan Nadabo nun Isirayilakae nu na Filisitakae gerefe tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasa a faxa Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ saxan nde nɛ, a ti Isirayila mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />A to findi mangɛ ra, a naxa Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ birin faxa. A mu keren lu, a e birin sɔntɔ nɛ, alɔ Alatala nu bara a masen ki naxɛ Annabi Ahiya saabui ra, naxan nu na Silo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />A faxa Yerobowami xa yunubi nan ma fe ra, naxan a niya Isirayila fan xa e kobe raso e Marigi Alatala ra.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Nadabo xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ nun a fe naxan birin naba, na sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Asa nun Isirayila mangɛ Baasa nu e boore gerema e xa simaya birin kui.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasa findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ saxan nde ra, Ahiya xa di Baasa naxa ti Isirayila mangɛ ra Tirisa. A bu nɛ mangɛya kui ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />A naxa fe raba naxan mu rafan Alatala ma, a bira Yerobowami xa kira fɔxɔ ra, naxan a niya Isirayila fan xa yunubi raba.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Baasa xa mangɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi ragoro Xanani xa di Yehu ma Baasa bɛ: <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />«N bara i tongo duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari, n i findi n ma ɲama xa mangɛ ra. Kɔnɔ i tan bara bira Yerobowami xa kira fɔxɔ ra, i n ma Isirayila ɲama ti yunubi rabafe ra, naxan bara n naxɔnɔ a ɲaaxi ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Na kui n i tan Baasa bama nɛ mangɛ ra, alɔ ginɛ a xa banxi kui makɔma ki naxɛ. N i bɔnsɔɛ luma nɛ, alɔ n Nebati xa di Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ luxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Baasa bɔnsɔɛ naxan na faxa taa kui, baree nan na donma. Naxan na faxa wula i, xɔnie nan na donma.»<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Baasa xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ nun a xa gere ki fanyi, birin sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baasa naxa laaxira, a naxa ragata Tirisa. A xa di Ela naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Alatala a xa masenyi ti nɛ Baasa nun a bɔnsɔɛ bɛ, Xanani xa di Annabi Yehu saabui ra. Na masenyi ti a xa fe ɲaaxie nan ma fe ra, naxee mu rafanxi Alatala ma. A nu bara maniya Yerobowami bɔnsɔɛ ra, a naxan sɔntɔ.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun senni nde ra, Baasa xa di Ela naxa ti Isirayila mangɛ ra. A xa mangɛya bu nɛ ɲɛ firin. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Simiri, a xa sɔɔri mangɛ nde, naxan nu findixi a xa sɔɔri ragisee sɛɛti keren xunyi ra, naxa yanfanteya xiri a xun. Lɔxɔɛ nde Ela nu na Tirisa a siisife Arisa xɔnyi, naxan findi na mangɛ xa banxi kantɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Simiri naxa so naa, a a faxa. Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun solofere nde ra, Simiri naxa ti Isirayila mangɛ ra Ela ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />A to findi mangɛ ra, a naxa dɔxɔ kibanyi, a Baasa bɔnsɔɛ birin faxa nɛ. A mu na xa mixi yo lu, na boore nde ba, na ɲɔxɔɛ ba. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Simiri Baasa bɔnsɔɛ birin sɔntɔ nɛ, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ Baasa xili ma Annabi Yehu saabui ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Baasa nun a xa di Ela faxa e xa yunubi fufafue nan ma fe ra, e Isirayila Marigi Alatala raxɔnɔxi naxee ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Ela xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ birin sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simiri findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun solofere nde ra, Simiri naxa mangɛya raba xi solofere bun ma Tirisa. Isirayila ɲama nu na Gibɛtɔn Filisitakae gerede. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Ɲama to a mɛ, a Simiri bara mangɛ yanfa, a a faxa, e naxa sɔɔri xunyi Omiri ti Isirayila mangɛ ra keren na. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Na tɛmui Omiri nun Isirayila sɔɔrie naxa keli Gibɛtɔn, e sa Tirisa rabilin.<verse eid="1KI 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Simiri to a to, taa birin nabilinxi, a naxa so mangɛ banxi kui, a na gan a yɛtɛ xun ma. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />A faxa a xa yunubie nan ma fe ra, naxee nu bara Alatala raxɔnɔ. A nu bara bira Yerobowami xa kira fɔxɔ ra, a a niya Isirayila ɲama fan xa yunubi raba.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Simiri xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ nun a xa yanfanteya sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omiri findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Na tɛmui Isirayila ɲama sɛɛti nu wama Ginati xa di Tibini tife mangɛ ra, boore sɛɛti nu wama Omiri nan xɔn. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Ɲama sɛɛti naxan nu na Omiri fɔxɔ ra, nee naxa nɔ Ginati xa di Tibini xa ɲama ra. E naxa Tibini faxa, e Omiri ti mangɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ tongo saxan nun keren nde ra, Omiri naxa findi Isirayila mangɛ ra, a bu na kui ɲɛ fu nun firin. A to gɛ ɲɛ senni rabade Tirisa, <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />a naxa Samari geya sara Semeri ma gbeti kilo tongo solofere ra. A naxa taa ti naa fari, a na taa xili sa Samari, barima na geya kanyi nu xili nɛ Semeri.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Omiri nu fe ɲaaxie rabama, naxee mu rafan Alatala ma. A xa fe ɲaaxie nu dangi Isirayila mangɛ singee gbee ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />A Nebati xa di Yerobowami fɔxi birin naba nɛ, a a niya Isirayila ɲama fan xa e Marigi Alatala raxɔnɔ e xa fe fufafue ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Omiri xa taruxui, nun a xa gere ki fanyi, na birin sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omiri naxa laaxira, a ragata a benbae sɛɛti ma Samari. A xa di Akabu naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akabu findife Isirayila mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Yudaya mangɛ Asa xa mangɛya ɲɛ tongo saxan nun solomasaxan nde ra, Omiri xa di naxa findi Isirayila mangɛ ra. A bu nɛ mangɛya kui Isirayila xun ma Samari ɲɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Akabu naxa fe ɲaaxie raba, naxee mu rafan Alatala ma, dangi mangɛ singee ra. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Bafe Nebati xa di Yerobowami xa yunubi ra, a naxa Sidɔn mangɛ Etibaali xa di Yesabela fan tongo ginɛ ra, a fa na xa kuye Bali batu, a a xinbi sin na bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />A naxa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan Bali kuye bɛ Bali xa banxi kui, naxan nu tixi Samari. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Akabu naxa Aseri wuri masolixie fan yailan, naxee nu xili Asera. Akabu naxa Alatala raxɔnɔ na fe mɔɔlie ra, dangife Isirayila mangɛ singee ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />A xa waxati, Xiyeli Betelika naxa gbilen Yeriko taa ti ra. A naa ti fɔlɔ a xa di singe Abirami sare nan na, a wali raɲɔn naadɛe tife nan ma a xa di Segubu sare ra, alɔ Alatala nu bara a masen ki naxɛ Nunu xa di Annabi Yosuwe saabui ra.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Eliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Eliya Tisibeka, naxan findi Galadi bɔxi mixi nde ra naxa a fala mangɛ Akabu bɛ, «N xa a fala i bɛ Isirayila Marigi Alatala xili ra, n naxan nabatuma, toofare tunɛ nun xini yo mu fama, fo n Ala maxandi.» <verse eid="1KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Alatala yi nan masen Annabi Eliya bɛ, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />a naxɛ, «Keli be, i xa siga sogetede biri ra, i sa i nɔxun Keriti xure yire. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />I xure ye nan minma, n donse rasanbama nɛ i ma xaxae saabui ra.»<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />A naxa siga, a a raba alɔ Alatala a fala a bɛ ki naxɛ, a sa sabati Keriti xure yire Yurudɛn sogetede biri. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Xaxae nu fama taami nun sube ra a xɔn ma gɛɛsɛgɛ nun nunmare. A nu xure ye nan minma. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Kɔnɔ tɛmui nde to dangi, na xure naxa xɔri, barima tunɛ mu nu fama na bɔxi ma na waxati.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />«Keli, i xa siga Sarepeta naxan na Sidɔn bɔxi ma. I xa lu naa. N bara yaamari fi kaaɲɛ ginɛ nde ma, a xa i balo.» <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />A naxa keli, a siga Sarepeta. A to so na taa kui, a naxa kaaɲɛ ginɛ nde to, a yege matongofe. A naxa na ginɛ xili, a a fala a bɛ, «Yandi, n ki ye ra n xa a min.» <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Ginɛ to nu sigafe ye fɔxɔ ra a bɛ, a man naxa a xili, a a fala a bɛ, «Yandi, i xa fa taami xuntunyi fan na n bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Ginɛ naxa a yaabi, «N xa a fala i bɛ i Marigi Alatala xili ra, taami yo mu na n yi ra, fo farin pɔɔti ya keren, a nun ture dondoronti kundi kui. N na yege di matongofe na nan ma, n xa sa na yailan n tan nun n ma di bɛ. Muxu na gɛ na donde, muxu fama faxade nɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya naxa a fala a bɛ, «Hali i mu gaaxu, sa a raba alɔ n a falaxi i bɛ ki naxɛ. Kɔnɔ i naxan nabama, i xa n ma taami nan singe yailan, i fa a ra. Na dangi xanbi, i xa i gbe nun i xa di gbe yailan. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala a masen nɛ, ‹Farin mu ɲɔnma pɔɔti kui, ture mu ɲɔnma kundi kui, beenun Alatala tunɛ rafama bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ.›»<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Na kui ginɛ naxa siga, a a raba alɔ Alatala a yamarixi ki naxɛ Annabi Eliya saabui ra. Na waxati bun ma baloe nu na a tan, a xa di, nun Annabi Eliya yi. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Farin mu nu ɲɔnma pɔɔti kui, ture mu nu ɲɔnma kundi kui alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ Annabi Eliya saabui ra.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Na fee to dangi, na kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa di naxa fura. Na fure sɛnbɛ naxa gbo, han a ɲɛngi naxa ɲɔn a fate i. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Ginɛ naxa a fala Annabi Eliya bɛ, «Munse na won tagi, i tan Ala xa mixi? I faxi nɛ n xɔnyi i xa fa n natu n ma yunubie ra, i man xa n ma di faxa?» <verse eid="1KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya naxa a yaabi, «I xa di so n yi ra.» A naxa dimɛdi tongo a nga yi ra, a a xanin a xa konkoe kui naxan nu na banxi kui koore kɔn na. A to a sa sade ma, <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />a naxa Alatala maxandi a bɛ, a naxɛ, «N Marigi Alatala, i wama n yatigi kaaɲɛ ginɛ tɔɔrɔfe yi ki nɛ, a xa di xa faxa?» <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />A naxa a yɛtɛ itala dimɛdi fate fari sanya saxan, a Alatala maxandima a falafe ra, «N Marigi Alatala, n bara i maxandi, i xa yi di ɲɛngi ragbilen a fate i.» <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Alatala naxa Annabi Eliya xa maxandi suxu, dimɛdi ɲɛngi naxa gbilen a fate i. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya naxa a tongo, a goro a ra a nga xɔn, a a fala a bɛ, «I xa di mato, a kisixi.» <verse eid="1KI 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Ginɛ naxa a fala Eliya bɛ, «Yakɔsi n bara a kolon a Ala xa mixi nan i ra, naxan Alatala xa masenyi tinxinxi masenma.»<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Eliya nun Mangɛ Akabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Tɛmui xɔn to kuya, Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Eliya bɛ a ɲɛ saxan nde ra, a naxɛ, «Siga Akabu yire, n tunɛ rafama nɛ bɔxi ma fa.» <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Eliya naxa siga Akabu yire. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Kaamɛ nu bara sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ Samari bɔxi ma. Akabu naxa Abadiyasi xili, naxan nu walima mangɛ banxi kui. A nu gaaxuma Alatala ya ra ki fanyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Yesabela nu Alatala xa namiɲɔnmɛe faxama tɛmui naxɛ, Abadiyasi namiɲɔnmɛ kɛmɛ tongo nɛ, a sa e nɔxun mixi tongo suuli suuli ma fɔnmɛ firin kui, a e balo ye nun taami ra.<verse eid="1KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Akabu naxa a fala Abadiyasi bɛ, a naxɛ, «I xa bɔxi birin isa mɛrɛ fende won ma soee nun won ma sofalee nɔma ɲooge sɔtɔde dɛnnaxɛ, alako e naxa faxa.» <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Akabu nun Abadiyasi naxa bɔxi itaxun e bore ma, e xa a isa. Akabu naxa siga kira nde xɔn, Abadiyasi naxa siga kira gbɛtɛ xɔn.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Abadiyasi naxa naralan Annabi Eliya ra kira xɔn. Abadiyasi to a to, a naxa a felen a bun ma, a a fala a bɛ, «N marigi Eliya, i tan yati nan a ra?» <verse eid="1KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, n tan nan a ra. Sa a fala i xa mangɛ bɛ, i bara Annabi Eliya to.» <verse eid="1KI 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Abadiyasi naxa a fala, «N haakɛ mundun nabaxi i ra naxan a niyama i xa yi mɔɔli raba n na? Yi findima faxɛ nan na n bɛ Akabu mabiri. <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />N xa a fala i bɛ i Marigi Alatala xili ra, ɲamanɛ nun bɔxi yo mu na, n ma mangɛ mu i fenxi dɛnnaxɛ. Mɛnnikae na a fala i mu na, Akabu e rakalima xa e mu i toxi. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Yakɔsi i naxɛ, ‹Sa a fala mangɛ bɛ i bara Annabi Eliya to.› <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Kɔnɔ n na keli i xun ma ya, Alatala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi fama i xaninde yire nde. Na kui, n na gɛ xɛɛra ibade Akabu bɛ, a lima muxu mu i toma be sɔnɔn, a fa n faxa na ma. N tan bara gaaxu Alatala ya ra kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />N marigi, e mu a falaxi i bɛ, n naxan naba Yesabela nu Alatala xa namiɲɔnmɛe faxama tɛmui naxɛ? N Alatala xa namiɲɔnmɛ kɛmɛ nan nɔxun fɔnmɛ kui tongo suuli suuli ma. N nu fa e balo taami nun ye ra. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, xa i n xɛɛ n ma mangɛ xɔn ma, n xa a fala a bɛ n bara Annabi Eliya to, a n faxama nɛ!» <verse eid="1KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Annabi Eliya naxa a yaabi, «N bara n kali n Marigi Alatala ra, to n nan n yɛtɛ masenma nɛ Akabu bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Abadiyasi naxa siga Akabu yire, a fa dɛntɛgɛ sa a bɛ. Akabu naxa siga Eliya fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />A to sa Eliya to, Akabu naxa a fala a bɛ, «I tan nan Isirayila ya isoxi yi ki?» <verse eid="1KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Annabi Eliya naxa a yaabi, «N tan xa mu Isirayila ya isoxi. I tan nun i baba bɔnsɔɛ nan Isirayila ya isoxi, barima wo bara Alatala xa yaamarie rabolo, i bira Bali kuye fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Yakɔsi, i xa Isirayila ɲama birin malan Karemele geya ma, a nun wo xa Bali kuye xa namiɲɔnmɛ kɛmɛ naani tongo suulie, a nun Asera kuye xa namiɲɔnmɛ kɛmɛ naanie, i xa ginɛ Yesabela naxee rabaloma.»<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Akabu naxa mixie xɛɛ Isirayilakae xilide. A naxa na namiɲɔnmɛe malan Karemele geya fari. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Na tɛmui Eliya naxa a maso ɲama birin na, a fa yi masenyi ti e bɛ, «Wo tan luma filankafuiɲa kui han mun tɛmui? Xa Alatala nan Ala ra, wo bira a fɔxɔ ra. Xa Bali nan Ala ra, wo bira a tan Bali fɔxɔ ra.» Ɲama mu a yaabi.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Annabi Eliya man naxa a fala e bɛ, «N keren nan be Alatala xa namiɲɔnmɛ ra. Bali xa namiɲɔnmɛe mixi kɛmɛ naani tongo suuli na be. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Wo xa tuura firin so muxu yi ra. Bali namiɲɔnmɛe xa e gbe sugandi, e xa a ibolon, e a sa yege fari, kɔnɔ tɛ mu dɔxɔma a ra. N tan fan xa tuura boore ibolon, n a sa yege gbɛtɛ fari, n fan mu tɛ dɔxɔma a ra. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Muxu na gɛ na rabade, Bali namiɲɔnmɛe xa wo marigi ala maxandi. N tan fan xa Alatala maxandi. Ala naxan na tɛ ragoro sɛrɛxɛ ma, na nan findima ɲama birin Marigi Ala ra.» Ɲama birin naxa tin na fe ra.<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Eliya naxa a fala Bali xa namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ, «Wo tuura keren sugandi, wo singe xa a ibolon, barima wo tan nan gbo. Wo wo marigi ala maxandi, kɔnɔ wo naxa tɛ sa.» <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />E naxa tuura keren tongo, e a ibolon, e a sa yege fari, e fa Bali maxandi fɔlɔ. Keli gɛɛsɛgɛ ma, han yanyi tagi, e a falama, «Bali, muxu yaabi.» Kɔnɔ yaabi yo mu fa, xui nde yo mu mɛ. E naxa tugan tugan fɔlɔ e xa sɛrɛxɛbade ya i. <verse eid="1KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Yanyi tagi to a li, Annabi Eliya naxa yo e ma, a falafe ra, «Wo wo xui ite de, barima a to findixi ala ra, fee wuya a yi. Tɛmunde a na biyaasi kui, xa na mu a ra a na xife. Wo xa a raxunu.»<verse eid="1KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />E man naxa e xui ite sɛnbɛ ra. E naxa e fate maxaba santidɛgɛmae nun tanbɛe ra, han e wuli mini. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Yanyi to dangi, e naxa Bali kuye maxandi a namiɲɔnmɛ daaxi han nunmare sɛrɛxɛ ba tɛmui. Kɔnɔ yaabi yo mu fa, xui nde yo mu mɛ, tɔnxuma nde yo mu to.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Na tɛmui Annabi Eliya naxa a fala ɲama bɛ, a naxɛ, «Wo wo maso n na.» Ɲama to na raba, Eliya naxa Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan, naxan nu bara kana mɛnni tɛmui dangixi. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya naxa gɛmɛ fu nun firin tongo, naxan lanxi Yaxuba xa die kɔnti ma, Alatala a masen naxan bɛ, «I xili falama nɛ Isirayila.» <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />A naxa sɛrɛxɛbade yailan na gɛmɛ fu nun firinyi ra Alatala xili ra. A naxa fole ge na sɛrɛxɛbade rabilinyi, ye konbo ya naani nɔma naxan nafede. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />A naxa yege sa na fari, a tuura ibolon, a na sa na yege fari.<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />A to gɛ na ra, a naxa mixie yamari, «Wo yi fɛɲɛ naani rafe ye ra, wo a ifili yi yege nun yi sɛrɛxɛ ma.» E to gɛ na rabade, a man naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo man xa a raba.» E to a raba a firin nde, Eliya man naxa a fala, «Wo man xa ye sa.» E naxa a raba a saxan nde. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Ye nu sɔli sɛrɛxɛbade ra, fole fa rafe ye ra.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Nunmare sɛrɛxɛ ba tɛmui, Annabi Eliya naxa a maso sɛrɛxɛbade ra, a a fala, «Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Isirayila Marigi Alatala, birin xa a kolon to a i tan nan na Ala ra Isirayila. Birin xa a kolon a n tan nan na i xa konyi ra, naxan yi fe birin nabaxi i xui ma! <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Alatala, i xa n ma maxandi suxu. Yandi, i xa a suxu, alako yi ɲama xa a kolon a i tan Alatala nan na Ala ra, naxan nɔma e bɔɲɛ ragbilende i ma.»<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Na kui Alatala naxa tɛ ragoro, a sɛrɛxɛ gan, a yege gan, hali gɛmɛe nun bɔxi gan nɛ. Ye naxan nu fole kui, a birin naxa xara feo. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Ɲama to na to, e naxa e yatagi rafelen bɔxi ma, e fa a fala, «Alatala nan Ala ra! Alatala nan Ala ra!» <verse eid="1KI 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Annabi Eliya naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo Bali xa namiɲɔnmɛe suxu. A keren naxa a gi.» Ɲama naxa e suxu, Eliya naxa e xanin Kison xure yire, a e birin kɔn naxaba.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Na tɛmui Eliya naxa a fala Akabu bɛ, «Siga i xɔnyi. I xa i dɛge, i xa i min, barima na xui i naxan mɛxi yi ki na fama tunɛ nan na.» <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Akabu naxa te a xɔnyi a dɛgede nun a minde, kɔnɔ Annabi Eliya tan naxa te Karemele geya fari, a fa a felen bɔxi ma, a yatagi fa lu a sanyie tagi. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />A naxa a fala a xa konyi bɛ, «Te yire itexi, i xa baa mabiri mato.» Konyi to te naa, a naxa baa mato, a mu sese gbɛtɛ to. Eliya naxa a ragbilen na yire itexi sanya solofere baa matode. <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />A sanya solofere nde, konyi naxa a fala, «Nuxui di nan tefe baa xun ma. A nun bɛlɛxɛ mɔndɛ lan.» Eliya naxa a fala a bɛ, «Siga, i xa sa a fala Akabu bɛ, a xa baki a xa sɔɔri ragise kui, a xa goro geya fari mafuren mafuren alako a naxa biri boora. Tunɛ na fafe!»<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Nuxuie naxa koore birin ifɔɔrɔ, foye naxa keli, tunɛ belebele naxa sin bɔxi ma. Akabu naxa te a xa sɔɔri ragise kui, a siga Yisireeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Alatala naxa sɛnbɛ fi Eliya ma, a fa a gi a sanyi ra, a dangi Akabu ya ra han Yisireeli sode dɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Eliya gaaxufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Akabu naxa sa dɛntɛgɛ sa Yesabela bɛ, Eliya naxan birin nabaxi, a a xa namiɲɔnmɛe faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra ki naxɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Yesabela naxa xɛɛra xɛɛ Eliya ma, a a fala a bɛ, «Xa n lu mu i faxa beenun tina yi waxati alɔ i n ma namiɲɔnmɛe faxa ki naxɛ, alae xa n danka.»<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Annabi Eliya to na mɛ, a naxa a gi a xa a nii ratanga. A naxa so Beriseeba Yudaya bɔxi ma, a naxa a xa konyi lu mɛnni. <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />A tan naxa siga gbengberenyi ma a fɛɛɲɛn keren ɲɛrɛ raba, a dɔxɔ wuri nde bun ma, a Ala maxandi faxɛ ra. A naxɛ, «Alatala, n ma tɔɔrɛ bara dangi a i. N nii tongo, barima n mu fisa n benbae bɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Na tɛmui a naxa a sa, a xi na wuri bun ma. Malekɛ nde naxa goro a ma, a din a ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Keli i xa i dɛge.» <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Taami ɲinxi nu na mɛnni gɛmɛ furee fari, a nun ye fɛɲɛ. A naxa a dɛge, a ye min, a man naxa a sa. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ala xa malekɛ naxa fa a ma a firin nde, a din a ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Keli i xa i dɛge, barima biyaasi xɔnkuye na i ya ra.» <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />A naxa keli, a a dɛge, a ye min. A sɛnbɛ naxan sɔtɔ na donsee ra, na naxa a niya a xa nɔ a ɲɛrɛde xi tongo naani, kɔɛ tongo naani bun ma, han a Ala xa Xorebe geya li.<verse eid="1KI 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Mɛnni a naxa kɔɛ radangi fɔnmɛ nde kui. Na tɛmui a naxa yi masenyi mɛ: «I na munse rabafe be Eliya?» <verse eid="1KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />A naxa a yaabi. «N bara n yɛtɛ fi i tan Alatala Sɛnbɛma ma. Isirayilakae bara i xa saatɛ rabolo, e bara i xa sɛrɛxɛbadee kana, e bara i xa namiɲɔnmɛe faxa santidɛgɛma ra. N keren nan fa luxi, e na katafe n fan faxade.» <verse eid="1KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, «Mini tande Alatala ya i, i keli fɔnmɛ kui.» A to mini, Alatala naxa dangi a ya i. Foye xungbe sɛnbɛma nde naxa a xun sa geya ma, a gɛmɛe ibɔɔma, a fanyee ibutuxunma, kɔnɔ Alatala mu nu na na foye kui. Na tɛmui bɔxi fan naxa sɛrɛn, kɔnɔ Alatala mu nu na na bɔxi sɛrɛnyi kui. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Na dangi xanbi, tɛ fan naxa mini, kɔnɔ Alatala mu nu na na tɛ xɔɔra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:12">Na to ba a ra, xui ɲɔxunmɛ nde naxa mini dɔyi dɔyi ra. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Annabi Eliya to na mɛ, a naxa a yatagi makoto a xa donma ra, a naxa mini fɔnmɛ kui, a ti fɔnmɛ dɛ ra. A mu bu, xui nde naxa mini a ma, a naxɛ, «I na munse rabafe be Eliya?» <verse eid="1KI 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />A naxa a yaabi, «N bara n yɛtɛ fi i tan Alatala Sɛnbɛma ma. Isirayilakae bara i xa saatɛ rabolo, e bara i xa sɛrɛxɛbadee kana, e bara i xa namiɲɔnmɛe faxa santidɛgɛma ra. N keren nan fa luxi, e na katafe n fan faxade.» <verse eid="1KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Alatala naxa a masen a bɛ, «I xa gbilen gbengberenyi kira xɔn ma sigafe ra Damasi. I na so naa, i xa ture sɛniyɛnxi sa Xasayeli xunyi a masenfe ra, a xa findi Arami mangɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />I xa ture sɛniyɛnxi sa Nimisi xa di Yehu fan ma, a xa findi Isirayila mangɛ ra. Na dangi xanbi i xa ture sa Elise xunyi, Safati xa di, Abeli Mexolaka xa mamadi, a tan xa findi namiɲɔnmɛ ra i ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Naxan na tanga Xasayeli xa santidɛgɛma ma, Yehu a faxama nɛ. Xa naxan tanga Yehu xa santidɛgɛma ma, Elise a faxama nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Kɔnɔ n mixi wulu solofere luma nɛ Isirayila, naxee mu suyidixi Bali kuye bɛ, e dɛ mu a sunbuxi.»<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Eliya naxa keli mɛnni, a sa Safati xa di Elise li, a na bɔxi buxafe. Ninge mɔxɔɲɛn nun naani nan nu ɲɛrɛfe a ya ra, a nu firinyi nan nawalife e xanbi ra. Eliya naxa dangi a fɛ ma, a naxa a xa donma woli a ma. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Elise naxa a xa ningee rabolo, a a gi Eliya fɔxɔ ra, a a fala a bɛ, «Yandi, i xa diɲɛ n xa sa n ɲungu nga nun n baba ma. Na tɛmui n birama nɛ i fɔxɔ ra.» Eliya naxa a fala a bɛ, «Gbilen i xa wali ra. I munse mɛxi n na?» <verse eid="1KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />A to a makuya Eliya ra, a naxa ninge firin tongo, a e ba sɛrɛxɛ ra. A naxa wurie findi yege ra e nu maxirixi naxee ra, a sube ɲin ɲama bɛ. Na dangi xanbi, a naxa bira Annabi Eliya fɔxɔ ra, a findi a xa batula ra.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Arami mangɛ Samari taa gerefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Arami mangɛ Ben Hadada naxa a xa sɔɔrie birin malan. Mangɛ tongo saxan nun firin nan nu e ya ma, soe nun sɔɔri ragisee nu na e yi ra. E naxa Samari rabilin, e fa gere ti e bɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Na kui Ben Hadada naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Isirayila mangɛ Akabu xɔn. <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />A naxa a fala a bɛ, «A lanma i xa i xa gbeti, i xa xɛɛma, i xa ginɛ tofanyie, nun i xa die birin findi n gbe ra.» <verse eid="1KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa a yaabi, «Mangɛ, n bara findi i xa konyi ra, n bara n harige birin fi i ma.»<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Na dangi xanbi mangɛ naxa xɛɛra gbɛtɛe xɛɛ a falafe ra, «Mangɛ Ben Hadada naxɛ, ‹A lanma i xa i xa gbeti, i xa xɛɛma, i xa ginɛ tofanyie, nun i xa die birin findi n gbe ra. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Tina yi waxati, n mixie xɛɛma nɛ i xɔnyi, e xa sa i xa banxi kui mato, a nun i xa mixie xa banxie, e xa se birin tongo naxan tide gbo i bɛ.›»<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa taa kuntigie xili, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa a kolon, a yi mixi wama won tɔɔrɔfe nɛ. N nu bara a fala a bɛ a n nan n ma ginɛe, n ma die, n ma xɛɛma, nun n ma gbeti birin fima nɛ a ma. N mu nu tondixi na sese ra.» <verse eid="1KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Kuntigie nun ɲama birin naxa a yaabi, «I naxa i tuli mati a ra, i naxa a danxun.»<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Na kui Akabu naxa a fala Ben Hadada xa xɛɛrae bɛ, «Wo sa a fala won ma mangɛ bɛ a a naxan singe fala, n bara tin na ra, kɔnɔ a naxan saxi na fari, n mu na rabama.» Xɛɛrae naxa gbilen na falade mangɛ Ben Hadada bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Ben Hadada naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ mangɛ Akabu ma a falafe ra, «Xa n mu Samari xun nakana, sese mu lu yi taa kui fa, mixi nɔma naxan matongode a bɛlɛxɛsole ra, alae xa n danka.» <verse eid="1KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila mangɛ naxa a yaabi, «Sɔɔri naxan na sigafe gere sode, a mu lan a xa a yɛtɛ matɔxɔ, alɔ sɔɔri naxan bara gɛ gere sode.» <verse eid="1KI 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Ben Hadada to na wɔyɛnyi mɛ, a nu na bere minfe nɛ a nun mangɛ gbɛtɛe e xa leelee bun ma. A naxa a fala a xa sɔɔrie bɛ, «Won xɛɛ gere sode.» Na kui e naxa e ya rafindi Samari taa ma.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Na tɛmui namiɲɔnmɛ nde naxa a maso Isirayila mangɛ Akabu ra, a naxa a masen a bɛ, «Alatala naxɛ, ‹I yi sɔɔri gali to? To yati n e birin sama nɛ i sagoe, alako i xa a kolon a n tan nan na Alatala ra.›» <verse eid="1KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Akabu naxa a maxɔrin, «A fama na rabade nde saabui ra?» Namiɲɔnmɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Alatala naxɛ i fama na rabade gominae xa sɛgɛtalae nan saabui ra.» Akabu naxa a maxɔrin, «Nde findima e xa yarerati ra na gere kui?» A naxa a yaabi, «I tan.» <verse eid="1KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Na kui Akabu naxa gominae xa sɛgɛtalae malan, e findi mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo saxan nun firin na. Isirayila ɲama naxan nu na e xanbi ra, e findi mixi wulu solofere nan na.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />E naxa mini gere sode yanyi tagi. A lixi Ben Hadada nun a malima mangɛ tongo saxan nun firin nu na bere minfe e xa leelee bun ma. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Gominae xa sɛgɛtalae singe naxa mini gere sode. Mixie naxa a fala Ben Hadada bɛ, «Sɔɔrie bara mini Samari taa kui.» <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />A naxa e yaabi, «Xa na sɔɔrie fafe lanyi nan fende, xa na mu a ra e wama gere sode, wo xa e suxu kɔnɔ wo naxa e faxa de.»<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Isirayila gominae xa sɛgɛtalae naxa mini, e nun Isirayila sɔɔri ɲama. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />E to gere so, kankan naxa mixi nde faxa. Aramikae naxa e gi keren na, Isirayilakae fa bira e fɔxɔ ra. Arami mangɛ Ben Hadada fan naxa a gi a xa soe fari, a nun sɔɔri nde naxee nu na sɔɔri ragisee kui. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa mini, a Aramikae xa soee faxa, a e xa sɔɔri ragisee kana. Na findi nɛ gbaloe ra Aramikae bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Na namiɲɔnmɛ man naxa a maso Isirayila mangɛ ra, a a fala a bɛ, «I xa wakili, i xa fee rafala, barima tamuna Arami mangɛ man fama nɛ i gerede.»<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Arami sɔɔrie naxa a fala e xa mangɛ bɛ, «Isirayilakae xa ala sɛnbɛ gbo geya nan fari. Na nan a toxi e won bɔnbɔxi. Xa won sa e gere fili nan ma nu, won nɔma nɛ e ra. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />I naxan nabama, i xa na mangɛe ba naxee na i xa mixie ya ma, i fa gominae ti e ɲɔxɔɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />I xa sɔɔri gbɛtɛe fen sɔɔri faxaxie ɲɔxɔɛ ra, i xa soe nun sɔɔri ragisee fen a kanaxie ɲɔxɔɛ ra. Na tɛmui, won man sigama e gerede fili nan ma, won fama nɛ nɔde e ra a fanyi ra.» Mangɛ naxa na birin naba, alɔ e a fala a bɛ ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Na ɲɛ igbilenyi, Ben Hadada naxa a xa sɔɔrie malan, a e xanin Afeki biri ra, e xa Isirayila gere. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Isirayilakae fan naxa e xa sɔɔrie malan, e fandɛ sɔtɔ, e siga e ralande. Isirayilakae to yonkin Arami ɲama ya i, e lu nɛ alɔ si gɔɔrɛ lanmadi firin Aramikae xa gboe xa fe ra.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Ala xa mixi naxa a maso Isirayila mangɛ ra, a a masen a bɛ, «Alatala xui nan yi ki: Aramikae to a fala a Alatala sɛnbɛ gbo geya nan fari a mu findixi ala ra fili tan ma, n e sama nɛ i sagoe, alako i xa a kolon n tan nan Alatala ra.» <verse eid="1KI 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />E naxa yonkin e boore ya i xi solofere bun ma. Na tɛmui gere naxa fɔlɔ, Isirayilakae fa Arami sɔɔrie mixi wulu kɛmɛ faxa. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />A dɔnxɔɛe naxa mini e gi ra Afeki tɛtɛ kui, kɔnɔ tɛtɛ fan yati naxa bira e ma, a mixi wulu mɔxɔɲɛn nun solofere faxa. Ben Hadada tan nu bara a gi, a sa a nɔxun konkoe nde kui.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />A xa sɔɔrie naxa a fala a bɛ, «Muxu a mɛ nɛ, a Isirayilakae xa mangɛe bɔɲɛ fan. Muxu xa bɛki dugi xiri muxu tagi, muxu xa luuti xiri muxu xunyie sunnunyi tɔnxuma ra, muxu xa muxu yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛ Isirayila mangɛ bɛ. Tɛmunde a diɲɛma i faxafe ma.» <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />E naxa bɛki dugi xiri e tagi, e luutie xiri e xunyie sunnunyi tɔnxuma ra, e fa e yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛ Isirayila mangɛ bɛ, e fa a fala, «I xa konyi Ben Hadada bara i mayandi i naxa a faxa.» Akabu naxa e yaabi, «A man baloxi? N ngaxakerenyi nan a ra.» <verse eid="1KI 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Na mixie to na mɛ, e naxa a maɲɔxun fe fanyi na a ra. E naxa mangɛ yaabi, «Iyo, Ben Hadada i ngaxakerenyi nan a ra!» Akabu naxa e yamari, «Wo sa fa a ra.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Ben Hadada naxa mini a nu na dɛnnaxɛ, a siga Akabu yire. Akabu naxa a baki a xa sɔɔri ragise kui. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ben Hadada naxa a fala a bɛ, «N taae ragbilenma nɛ i ma, n baba naxee ba i baba yi ra. I nɔma i xa makiti tide Damasi, alɔ n baba gbe to nu na Samari.» Akabu naxa a fala a bɛ, «Won xa saatɛ xiri, n fa i bɛɲin.» E to saatɛ xiri, a naxa a bɛɲin.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Namiɲɔnmɛ nde naxa a fala a ɲɛrɛ boore bɛ Alatala xui ra, «N bɔnbɔ.» Kɔnɔ a ɲɛrɛ boore mu tin a bɔnbɔde. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Na kui, a naxa a fala a ɲɛrɛ boore bɛ, «I to mu tinxi i tuli matide Alatala xa masenyi ra, yɛtɛ nde fama nɛ i faxade.» A to keli mɛnni, yɛtɛ naxa dutun a ma, a a faxa. <verse eid="1KI 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Na namiɲɔnmɛ naxa siga mixi gbɛtɛ fan yire, a a fala a bɛ, «N bɔnbɔ.» Na kanyi naxa a bɔnbɔ han a a maxɔnɔ.<verse eid="1KI 20:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Namiɲɔnmɛ naxa sa ti kira ra mangɛ nu dangima dɛnnaxɛ. A naxa a yatagi maxiri dugi nde ra a fi daaxi. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Mangɛ to dangi naa, namiɲɔnmɛ naxa a fala mangɛ bɛ a xui itexi ra, «N tan i xa sɔɔri, n nu na gere yire nɛ. Sɔɔri nde naxa mini gere ya ma, a fa won yaxui suxuxi nde taxu n na, a a fala n bɛ, ‹Yi xɛmɛ suxu gben. Xa a a ba i yi, i nii nan findima a sare ra, xa na mu i kɔbiri ba.› <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Kɔnɔ n nu yanfaxi wali nde kui, na xɛmɛ suxuxi naxa nɔ a gide.» Mangɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «I bara i yɛtɛ makiiti. A lanma i xa faxa.»<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Na tɛmui namiɲɔnmɛ naxa dugi ba a yatagi ma, Isirayila mangɛ naxa a kolon fa namiɲɔnmɛ nde nan a ra. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />A naxa a fala mangɛ bɛ, «I to bara i yaxui bɛɲin n naxan saxi i bɛlɛxɛ i, n mixi naxan natɔnxi, i nii nan findima a sare ra, i xa ɲama findima a xa ɲama sare nan na.» <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Na kui Isirayila mangɛ naxa gbilen a xɔnyi Samari sunnunyi nun bɔɲɛ maɲaaxui kui.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Naboti xa sansi yire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Yisireelika nde nu na naxan xili Naboti. Sansi yire nu na a yi ra Samari mangɛ Akabu xa bɔxi fɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Akabu naxa a fala Naboti bɛ, «I xa i xa sansi yire so n yi ra, n xa a findi n ma laakɔɛ yire ra, barima a makɔrɛ n ma banxi ra. N sansi yire gbɛtɛ soma i yi ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra naxan fan na bɛ, xa na mu a ra, n xa a sara kɔbiri ra.» <verse eid="1KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Naboti naxa Akabu yaabi, a naxɛ, «Alatala xa n natanga n benbae kɛ sofe ra i yi.»<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Akabu naxa so a xɔnyi, a sunnunxi ra, a bɔɲɛ maɲaaxuxi Yisireelika Naboti xa masenyi xa fe ra, a falafe ra, «N mu n benbae kɛ soma i yi ra.» A naxa a sa, a a kobe raso mixie ra, a mu tin donse donde. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />A xa ginɛ Yesabela naxa siga a yire, a a maxɔrin, «Munfe ra i bɔɲɛ maɲaaxuxi, i mu tin i dɛgede?» <verse eid="1KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />A naxa a yaabi, «N bara a fala Yisireelika Naboti bɛ a xa a xa sansi yire so n yi ra, n xa a sara, xa na mu a ra, n xa sansi yire gbɛtɛ so a yi ra, kɔnɔ a mu tin na ra fefe ma.» <verse eid="1KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Na kui, a xa ginɛ Yesabela naxa a fala a bɛ. «Pe, i tan xa mu findixi Isirayila mangɛ ra? Awa, mangɛ, keli, i xa i dɛge ɲɛlɛxinyi kui. N tan Yisireelika Naboti xa sansi yire soma nɛ i yi ra!»<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />A xa ginɛ naxa bataaxɛ sɛbɛ Akabu xili ra, a mangɛ Akabu xa tɔnxuma sa a ma, a fa a rasanba forie nun kuntigie ma, naxee nu sabatixi Naboti xa taa kui. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />A sɛbɛxi bataaxɛ kui, «Wo sunyi nun sali rabafe ti ɲama bɛ, Naboti xa dɔxɔ ɲama birin ya i. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Wo xa fuyante firin dɔxɔ a ya i, naxee a tɔɔɲɛgɛma, a falafe ra a bara Ala nun mangɛ konbi. Na kui wo xa a ramini taa kui, wo a magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han a xa faxa.»<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Naboti xa taa mixie, forie nun kuntigie naxa a raba, alɔ Yesabela a yamarixi ki naxɛ na bataaxɛ kui. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />E naxa sun e sali, e Naboti dɔxɔ ɲama birin ya tode ra, <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />e fa fuyante firinyi radɔxɔ a yire. Na fuyante firinyie naxa Naboti tɔɔɲɛgɛ ɲama ya i, a falafe ra, «Naboti bara Ala nun mangɛ konbi.» Ɲama naxa Naboti xanin taa fari ma, e a magɔnɔ han a faxa. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />E naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Yesabela ma, a falafe ra, «Naboti bara magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra, a bara faxa.»<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yesabela to a mɛ a Naboti bara magɔnɔ gɛmɛ ra han a bara faxa, a naxa siga Akabu yire, a a fala a bɛ, «Yakɔsi keli, i xa Naboti xa sansi yire tongo, Naboti Yisireelika tondi naxan sarade i ma kɔbiri ra. Naboti a mu na sɔnɔn, a bara faxa.» <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Akabu to a mɛ, a Naboti bara faxa, a naxa keli keren na, a sa Naboti xa sansi yire findi a gbe ra.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Eliya Tisibeka bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />«Siga Isirayila mangɛ Akabu yire Samari. A na Naboti xa sansi yire, a naxan findixi a gbe ra. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />I xa a fala a bɛ, ‹Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: «I bara faxɛ ti, i bara mixi kɛ muɲa! Baree fama i wuli makɔnde, e Naboti wuli makɔnxi dɛnnaxɛ.»›» <verse eid="1KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Akabu naxa Eliya yaabi, «I tan n yaxui, i bara n to?» A naxa a fala a bɛ, «Iyo, n bara i to. I to i yɛtɛ fi fe ɲaaxi rabafe ma, naxan mu rafanxi Alatala ma, <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />n gbaloe ragoroma nɛ i ma, n i bama nɛ Isirayila, n xɛmɛ birin faxa xɔrɛ nun konyi i bɔnsɔɛ ya ma Isirayila. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />N i xa fɔxɛ luma nɛ, alɔ Nebati xa di Yerobowami nun Ahiya xa di Baasa xa fɔxɛe, barima i bara n naxɔnɔ, i man bara Isirayila ɲama birin naɲɛrɛ yunubi kui.»<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />«Alatala xa masenyi nan ya Yesabela xa fe ra, a naxɛ, ‹Baree fama nɛ Yesabela donde Yisireeli tɛtɛ fɛ ma. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Akabu xa mixi naxan na faxa taa kui, baree nan na donma. Naxan na faxa wula i, yubɛe nan na donma.›»<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Mixi yo mu na naxan a yɛtɛ fi fe ɲaaxi rabafe ma alɔ Akabu. A xa ginɛ Yesabela nu a bɔɲɛ ratema na fe kui. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />A nu fe ɲaaxi rabama dangi mixi birin na. A nu kuyee batuma alɔ Amorikae, Alatala naxee keri Isirayilakae ya ra.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Akabu to Annabi Eliya xa masenyi mɛ, a naxa a xa donma ibɔɔ sunnunyi kui, a naxa sunnun dugi ragoro a ma, a sunyi suxu. A nu a sama sade ma, na sunnun dugi ragoroxi a ma, xa na mu a nu ɲɛrɛ dɔyi dɔyi a sunnunxi ra. <verse eid="1KI 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Alatala naxa a masen Eliya Tisibeka bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />«I bara a to Akabu a yɛtɛ magoroxi n bɛ ki naxɛ? A to bara a yɛtɛ magoro n bɛ, n mu gbaloe ragoroma a ma fanni a baloxi. N gbaloe ragoroma a bɔnsɔɛ ma a xa di xa waxati nɛ.»<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Akabu xa geree</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">Yudaya Mangɛe II 18:2-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Ɲɛ saxan naxa dangi, gere yo mu lu Arami nun Isirayila tagi. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />A ɲɛ saxan nde ra, Yudaya mangɛ Yehosafati naxa goro Isirayila mangɛ yire. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa a fala a xa mixie bɛ, «Wo a kolon a Ramoti, naxan na Galadi bɔxi ma, won tan nan gbe a ra. Won naxa siikɛ a rasuxude Arami mangɛ yi ra.» <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Isirayila mangɛ Akabu naxa a fala Yudaya mangɛ Yehosafati bɛ, «Won birin na a ra sigafe Ramoti Galadi bɔxi ma?» Yehosafati naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, i tan yo n tan yo, won birin keren. Won ma ɲamae nun won ma soe fan a birin keren.»<verse eid="1KI 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Yehosafati naxa a fala Isirayila mangɛ bɛ, «N bara i maxandi, won xa Alatala sago fen yi fe kui yakɔsi.» <verse eid="1KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa namiɲɔnmɛ kɛmɛ naani malan, a e maxɔrin, «A lanma ka a mu lanma won xa siga Ramoti gerede Galadi bɔxi ma?» E naxa a yaabi, «Wo te, Ala fama e sade i sagoe mangɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Kɔnɔ Yehosafati naxa mangɛ maxɔrin, «Alatala xa namiɲɔnmɛ nde mu na be, won nɔma naxan maxɔrinde?» <verse eid="1KI 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa Yehosafati yaabi, «Xɛmɛ keren peti nan be, won nɔma Alatala maxɔrinde naxan saabui ra, kɔnɔ a mu rafan n ma, barima a xunnakanɛ fe nan gbansan falama n ma fe ra. A mu xunnakeli fe yo falama n bɛ. A xili Mike. Yimila xa di na a ra.» Yehosafati naxa a fala, «A mu lanma mangɛ xa na wɔyɛn mɔɔli fala.» <verse eid="1KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Na kui, Isirayila mangɛ naxa a xa batula keren xili, a a fala a bɛ, «Fa Yimila xa di Mike ra n bɛ keren na.»<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Isirayila mangɛ nun Yudaya mangɛ Yehosafati nu dɔxɔxi e xa kibanyie kui, mangɛ donmae ragoroxi e ma. E nu na lonyi ma, Samari taa sode dɛ ra. Namiɲɔnmɛe nu na e xa masenyie tife e bɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Kenaana xa di Sedekiya nu bara feri wure daaxie yailan, a fa a fala mangɛe bɛ, «Alatala xa masenyi nan ya: ‹Wo Aramikae bɔnbɔma yi ferie nan na han e sɔntɔ.›» <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Namiɲɔnmɛ birin nu na masenyi mɔɔli falama e bɛ. E naxa a fala, «Wo te Ramoti Galadi bɔxi ma. Wo xunnakeli nan sɔtɔma, Alatala fama nɛ e sade mangɛ sagoe.»<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Xɛɛra naxan siga Mike xilide, na naxa a fala a bɛ, «I bara a to, namiɲɔnmɛ birin bara lan e xa fe fanyi fala mangɛ bɛ. I fan xa kata, wo xui xa lu keren, i xa fe fanyi fala mangɛ bɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Mike naxa a fala, «Alatala ɲiɲɛ na a ra. N Marigi Alatala na naxan yo masen, n na nan falama.»<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />A to mangɛ yire li, mangɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Mike, a lanma ka a mu lanma muxu xa siga gere sode Ramoti Galadi bɔxi ma?» Mike naxa a yaabi, «Wo te, wo xunnakeli nan sɔtɔma. Alatala fama nɛ e sade wo sagoe.» <verse eid="1KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Kɔnɔ mangɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ɲan bara a fala i bɛ sanya wuyaxi, i xa i kali nɔndi yati nan falade n bɛ Alatala xili ra.»<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Mike naxa a yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">«N bara Isirayila birin to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">e yensenxi geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">alɔ xuruse rabɛɲinxie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">Marigi mu na yi ɲama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 22:17">Kankan xa gbilen a xɔnyi bɔɲɛsa kui.»<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa a fala Yehosafati bɛ, «N mu a fala xɛ i bɛ, a mu nɔma fe fanyi masende n ma fe ra, fo fe ɲaaxi tun?»<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Na tɛmui Mike naxa a fala e bɛ, «Yakɔsi, wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra. N bara Alatala to a xa kibanyi kui, a xa malekɛ gali nu tixi a yirefanyi ma nun a kɔɔla ma. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Alatala naxa a fala, ‹Nde wama sigafe xaxili kobi rasode Isirayila mangɛ Akabu xunyi, a xa sa Ramoti gere Galadi bɔxi ma alako a xa faxa?› Nde naxa a yaabi xaxili nde ra, nde fan naxa a yaabi xaxili gbɛtɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Na kui ɲinnɛ nde naxa mini, a ti Alatala ya i, a a fala, ‹N tan nɔma nɛ a ra.› Alatala naxa a maxɔrin, ‹I nɔma di?› <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />A naxa a yaabi, ‹N sigama nɛ, n fa wule fala mangɛ bɛ a xa namiɲɔnmɛe saabui ra.› Alatala naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹I fama nɛ a nɔde, na sɔɔnɛyama nɛ. Siga, i xa sa na raba.› <verse eid="1KI 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Yakɔsi, Alatala bara wule sa i xa namiɲɔnmɛe dɛ i. Ala bara natɛ ɲaaxi tongo i xa fe ra.»<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Na tɛmui, Kenaana xa di Sedekiya naxa a maso, a Mike dɛ ragarin, a fa a fala, «Alatala Xaxili minixi kira mundun na n ma n xa wɔyɛn i bɛ?» <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mike naxa a yaabi, «I fama na tode, i i gima i nɔxunde fende tɛmui naxɛ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa a fala, «Wo Mike xanin taa mangɛ Amon nun mangɛ xa di Yowasi xɔn ma. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Wo xa a fala e bɛ, ‹Mangɛ naxɛ, a wo xa yi xɛmɛ sa geeli kui, a wo naxa donse so a yi ra, fo taami xare nun ye, han n sa fama tɛmui naxɛ xunnakeli kui.›» <verse eid="1KI 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Mike naxa a yaabi, «Xa i sa gbilen xunnakeli kui, n ma masenyi mu kelixi Alatala ma.» A man naxa a fala ɲama ya xɔri, «Ɲama birin, wo xa wo tuli mati n ma masenyi ra a fanyi ra!»<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Isirayila mangɛ nun Yudaya mangɛ Yehosafati naxa te Ramoti Galadi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Isirayila mangɛ naxa a fala Yehosafati bɛ, «I xa so gere kui mangɛ donma ragoroxi i ma.» Isirayila mangɛ tan naxa mangɛ dugi ba a ma, a sɔɔri donma gbansan nagoro a ma, a siga gere sode. <verse eid="1KI 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Arami mangɛ nu bara a fala a xa sɔɔri tongo saxan nun firinyi bɛ, naxee findixi sɔɔri ragise xa sɔɔrie yareratie ra, «Wo xa katɛ birin naba wo xa Isirayila mangɛ gbansan nan fen, wo a faxa.» <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Sɔɔri ragise xa sɔɔrie yareratie to Yehosafati to, e naxa a maɲɔxun tɛmunde Isirayila mangɛ nan a ra. E naxa e xun ti a ra, e xa sa a gere. Yehosafati naxa a malimae xili. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Sɔɔri ragise xa sɔɔrie yareratie naxa a kolon Isirayila mangɛ xa mu a ra, e fa gbilen a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="1KI 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Na tɛmui sɔɔri nde naxa xali woli na ki tun. Tanbɛ naxa sa Isirayila mangɛ sɔxɔ a kanke makantase lenbee tagi. Mangɛ naxa a fala a xa sɔɔri ragise ragima bɛ, «Gise mafindi, i xa n namini gere fari ma, barima n bara maxɔnɔ.» <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Gere naxa xɔrɔxɔ na lɔxɔɛ ki fanyi ra. Mangɛ nu tixi a xa sɔɔri ragise kui, a ya rafindixi Aramikae ma. A naxa faxa na nunmare ra, a wuli gbegbe nu na a xa sɔɔri ragise kui. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Soge goro tɛmui, yaamari naxa fi, «Birin xa gbilen e xɔnyi, birin xa siga e xa bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Mangɛ faxa na ki nɛ, a naxa ragata Samari taa kui. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />E to mangɛ xa sɔɔri ragise kui ixa Samari ye yire, baree naxa Akabu wuli makɔn, langoe ginɛe fan naxa e maxa naa, alɔ Alatala a masen ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Akabu xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ, nun a fe naxan birin naba, nun a banxi tixi ki naxɛ sili ɲinyie ra, nun a taa naxee ti, na birin sɛbɛxi Isirayila mangɛe xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Akabu naxa ragata a benbae fɛ ma. A xa di Axasiya naxa findi mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehosafati findife Yudaya mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">Yudaya Mangɛe II 20:31-21:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Asa xa di Yehosafati findi Yudaya mangɛ ra, Isirayila mangɛ Akabu xa mangɛya ɲɛ naani nde nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Ɲɛ tongo saxan nun suuli nu na Yehosafati bɛ, a to nu findima mangɛ ra Darisalamu. A nga nu na Sili xa di Asuba nan na. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Yehosafati naxa ɲɛrɛ a baba Asa xa kira xɔn ma, a mu a makuya Alatala xa kira ra. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Kɔnɔ kuye batufe yire itexie ma, na mu dan Yudaya bɔxi ma. Mixie mu tagan sɛrɛxɛ bafe ra naa, a nun surayi ganfe sɛrɛxɛ ra. <verse eid="1KI 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Lanyi nu na Yehosafati nun Isirayila mangɛ tagi.<verse eid="1KI 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Yehosafati xa taruxui dɔnxɔɛ, nun a xa gere ki fanyi, na sɛbɛxi Yudaya mangɛe xa taruxui kui. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />A naxa tɔnyi dɔxɔ langoe xa wali ma kuye batudee, naxee nu na kabi a baba Asa waxati. <verse eid="1KI 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Mangɛ nu na Edon, Yudaya mangɛ gomina nde nan ti naa. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Yehosafati naxa kunkuie yailan Tarasisi, alako e xa siga xɛɛma fende Ofiri, kɔnɔ kunkuie naxa kana Esiyon Geberi. <verse eid="1KI 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Na kui Akabu xa di Axasiya naxa a fala Yehosafati bɛ, «N ma mixie nun i i xa mixie birin xa siga na wali rabade kunkuie kui.» Kɔnɔ Yehosafati mu tin na fe ra. <verse eid="1KI 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Yehosafati naxa bɛlɛ a benbae fɛ ma, a ragata a benba Dawuda xa taa kui. A xa di Yehorami naxa ti mangɛ ra a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="1KI 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila mangɛ Axasiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Akabu xa di Axasiya naxa findi mangɛ ra Samari, Isirayila bɔxi xun ma, Yudaya mangɛ Yehosafati xa mangɛya ɲɛ fu nun solofere nde ra. A bu nɛ mangɛya kui ɲɛ firin Isirayila xun ma. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />A naxa fe raba, naxan mu rafan Alatala ma, a naxa a ɲɛrɛ a baba nun a nga xa kira xɔn ma. A naxa fe raba alɔ Nebati xa di Yerobowami, naxan a niya Isirayila birin xa yunubi raba. <verse eid="1KI 22:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 22:54" />A naxa Bali kuye batu, a a xinbi sin a bɛ. Na kui a naxa Isirayila Marigi Alatala raxɔnɔ, alɔ a baba a raba ki naxɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>